(93, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"96d47848-6838-412e-80f6-a404531a6a33\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:8:\\\"overview\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:1502:\\\"<div data-cy=\\\"themeProductMessaging-slot\\\" data-v-3dd118f2=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"trip-page__theme-product-messaging\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"tile tile--x-large\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\" data-cy=\\\"theme-product-messaging\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"trip-overview__grid trip-overview__grid--2-cols\\\" data-v-3dd118f2=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<div data-cy=\\\"introduction\\\" data-v-3dd118f2=\\\"\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"lead\\\" data-cy=\\\"tagline\\\"><strong>Wander through an ancient Wonder of the World, discover temples and sail the Nile<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"expandable-section\\\" data-cy=\\\"expandable-section\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"expandable-section__body\\\" data-cy=\\\"expandable-section-body\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"json-rich-text\\\" data-cy=\\\"json-rich-text\\\">\\r\\n<p>Ancient history, golden sands and crowded souqs &ndash; Egypt is the ultimate destination for any adventurous traveller. This nine-day trip is the perfect mix of blockbuster wonders and intimate moments, with loads of planned activities and plenty of time to wander at your own pace. Your local leader will take you to bucket list icons like the Pyramids of Giza (one of the Seven Wonders of the World) in Cairo and the Valley of the Kings in Luxor, then guide you off the beaten path to eat koshari in a local downtown joint, or into a bazaar to meet a perfume merchant. Kayak along the Nile, spend a night on a traditional felucca under starry skies and drink your body weight in mint tea. The best part? You&rsquo;ll do it all with like-minded travellers your own age.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:17:\\\"tour_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:4;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:7:\\\"tour_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"fr\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translations\\\";s:5:\\\"delay\\\";i:120;}\"}}', 0, NULL, 1753973329, 1753973209),
