(129, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"750695f6-9828-4ac2-874c-69dc02d1f768\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:8:\\\"overview\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:1062:\\\"<p class=\\\"lead\\\" data-cy=\\\"tagline\\\"><strong>Unlock Egypt&rsquo;s ancient past, hitting all the must-see sites, tombs and Wonders of the World<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"expandable-section\\\" data-cy=\\\"expandable-section\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"expandable-section__body\\\" data-cy=\\\"expandable-section-body\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"json-rich-text\\\" data-cy=\\\"json-rich-text\\\">\\r\\n<p>Take to the Nile Valley on a nine-day Premium adventure by river, road and air, visiting the mighty pyramids of Giza, one of the ancient Wonders of the World. See the majestic temples of Karnak, the famous tomb of Tutankhamun and Cairo&rsquo;s bustling Khan al-Khalili Bazaar. Spend an evening with a Nubian family and another with an Egyptian family in Cairo for a look at local life and enjoy plenty of time for independent discoveries in each destination. Tuck into Egypt&rsquo;s unique cuisine, cruise down the Nile on a riverboat and a felucca and visit Cairo&rsquo;s oldest coffeeshop. With an ancient past that has led to a colourful present, Egypt is a traveller&rsquo;s dream!<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:17:\\\"tour_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:5;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\