(176, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"4bda89b2-d054-4b5b-ac42-a69861009a45\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:8:\\\"question\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:60:\\\"▪ Why should I book with a Travel agency and not by myself\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:16:\\\"faq_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:3;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:6:\\\"faq_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"es\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translations\\\";s:5:\\\"delay\\\";i:50;}\"}}', 0, NULL, 1753976262, 1753976212),
(177, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"eafcab8a-8a87-4e10-ab47-ff0e9e73c9e8\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:6:\\\"answer\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:1078:\\\"<p>- When you search the internet for reservations and transfers or hotels directly, without the&nbsp;<br>help of agencies, you may have several surprises. Some of them can turn into&nbsp;<br>disappointments. So having someone accredited by your side, who can protect you from&nbsp;<br>these situations, is really necessary for your tranquility and security<br>- Travel agents now differentiate themselves by offering a curated, hands-on, and personalized&nbsp;<br>service.<br>A good travel agent can:<br>Connect you with trusted tour operators they&rsquo;ve worked with before<br>Find the perfect airfares, rental cars, and cruise ships\\/cruise lines to fit your itinerary<br>Help you save money with exclusive upgrades, discounts, and perks that aren&rsquo;t available to&nbsp;<br>the general public<br>Offer personalized service and peace of mind<br>Help you organize a group trip or family trip that meets all travelers&rsquo; requirements, saving&nbsp;<br>you time and effort<br>Manage trip cancellations and changes, and find flexible fares that fall within your budget<\\/p>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:16:\\\"faq_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:3;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:6:\\\"faq_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"fr\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translations\\\";s:5:\\\"delay\\\";i:60;}\"}}', 0, NULL, 1753976272, 1753976212),
(178, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"57fc2bd3-30b2-430f-b120-d7bf73bf56d4\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:6:\\\"answer\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:1078:\\\"<p>- When you search the internet for reservations and transfers or hotels directly, without the&nbsp;<br>help of agencies, you may have several surprises. Some of them can turn into&nbsp;<br>disappointments. So having someone accredited by your side, who can protect you from&nbsp;<br>these situations, is really necessary for your tranquility and security<br>- Travel agents now differentiate themselves by offering a curated, hands-on, and personalized&nbsp;<br>service.<br>A good travel agent can:<br>Connect you with trusted tour operators they&rsquo;ve worked with before<br>Find the perfect airfares, rental cars, and cruise ships\\/cruise lines to fit your itinerary<br>Help you save money with exclusive upgrades, discounts, and perks that aren&rsquo;t available to&nbsp;<br>the general public<br>Offer personalized service and peace of mind<br>Help you organize a group trip or family trip that meets all travelers&rsquo; requirements, saving&nbsp;<br>you time and effort<br>Manage trip cancellations and changes, and find flexible fares that fall within your budget<\\/p>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:16:\\\"faq_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:3;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:6:\\\"faq_