(188, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"b1d199c8-6b88-4823-8316-3dae413c29bb\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:8:\\\"question\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:76:\\\"Can I get a visa on arrival from other border crossings other than airports?\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:16:\\\"faq_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:2;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:6:\\\"faq_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"es\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translations\\\";s:5:\\\"delay\\\";i:50;}\"}}', 0, NULL, 1753976312, 1753976262),
(189, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"da7cd0dd-3bc4-447e-9d6b-5c69091b6180\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:6:\\\"answer\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:1076:\\\"<p>Regarding the conditions for obtaining a visa at border crossings and ports, they are applied in accordance with the policy for obtaining an Egyptian visa, as mentioned previously.<br>But kindly note that in some ports, guarantee letter will be required and also permission from the tourism police, to leave the port and return and your travel agent will help you in this case by providing the guarantee letter.<br>It is therefore possible to apply for an Egyptian visa on arrival at the border control for the countries that take the visa upon arrival<br>However, it is strongly advised against crossing the land border as information on checkpoints that issue visas on arrival is not always up to date.<br>Thus, applying for a visa on arrival in Egypt can be done mainly at the following international checkpoints:<br><br>Cairo International Airport<br><br>Hurghada International Airport<br><br>St Catherine\'s International Airport<br><br>Borg El Arab International Airport in Alexandria<br><br>Sharm El Sheikh International Airport<br><br>Luxor International Airport<\\/p>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:16:\\\"faq_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:2;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:6:\\\"faq_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"fr\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translations\\\";s:5:\\\"delay\\\";i:60;}\"}}', 0, NULL, 1753976322, 1753976262),
(190, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"dcef5c59-5930-4f08-a72b-6d0c88e1fb60\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:6:\\\"answer\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:1076:\\\"<p>Regarding the conditions for obtaining a visa at border crossings and ports, they are applied in accordance with the policy for obtaining an Egyptian visa, as mentioned previously.<br>But kindly note that in some ports, guarantee letter will be required and also permission from the tourism police, to leave the port and return and your travel agent will help you in this case by providing the guarantee letter.<br>It is therefore possible to apply for an Egyptian visa on arrival at the border control for the countries that take the visa upon arrival<br>However, it is strongly advised against crossing the land border as information on checkpoints that issue visas on arrival is not always up to date.<br>Thus, applying for a visa on arrival in Egypt can be done mainly at the following international checkpoints:<br><br>Cairo International Airport<br><br>Hurghada International Airport<br><br>St Catherine\'s International Airport<br><br>Borg El Arab International Airport in Alexandria<br><br>Sharm El Sheikh International Airport<br><br>Luxor International Airport<\\/p>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:16:\\\"faq_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:2;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:6:\\\"faq_id\