(245, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"3b4f667e-ac7d-4ddd-a1d3-abed1d924329\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:11:\\\"description\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:2941:\\\"<p id=\\\"custom-heading-2\\\">Egypt is a destination for all seasons, where you can experience the wonders of ancient and modern times. But when is the best time to visit this captivating country? It depends on what you&rsquo;re looking for.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-3\\\">If you want to enjoy the sun and the sand, winter is the&nbsp;Best Time to Visit Egypt. From December to February, you can unwind on the beaches, admire the pyramids of Giza, and cruise on the Nile. The weather is mild and cozy, making it perfect for outdoor activities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-4\\\">If you want to avoid the heat and the crowds, spring and autumn are the best seasons to visit Egypt. From March to May and from September to November, you can explore the temples and tombs at your own pace and enjoy the moderate temperatures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-5\\\">Egypt is a land of endless possibilities, where you can discover its rich history and culture, its stunning nature and wildlife, and its friendly and hospitable people. Whatever season you choose, you&rsquo;ll find something to suit your taste and budget.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><strong>Best Time for sightseeing in cooler temperatures<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-8\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>October - February<br><\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-11\\\"><strong>How do you enjoy Egypt&rsquo;s ancient and natural attractions in the coolest season?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-12\\\">The Perfect Time to Discover and Relax In the Northern European winter, many travelers (and tour groups) flee the gloomy skies back home to enjoy the beaches of Sharm el-Sheikh and the Red Sea coast this time of year, is the&nbsp;Best time to travel to Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-13\\\">You&rsquo;ll experience pleasant weather across most of the country, although in Cairo and Alexandria, expect some rain. Suppose you&rsquo;re here to explore Luxor&rsquo;s abundance of Pharaonic wonders. In that case, winter brings clear skies and cozy daytime temperatures to make long days of wandering around ancient ruins a delight rather than a challenge.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-14\\\">This is also the&nbsp;&nbsp;Best time to travel to Egypt and the&nbsp;most popular season to venture into the Sinai or the Western Desert for outdoor adventures (from hiking to camel trekking) or to soak up the winter sun while learning to dive in South Sinai and along the Red Sea coast. Divers should note that sea conditions can be rough on boat dives around December, but shore dives are usually fine.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p id=\\\"custom-heading-15\\\">In Cairo, the mild weather makes November an excellent time for long walks to admire the capital&rsquo;s madrassas and mosques. Be aware it will be chillier than you might think (especially after dark), so you also need to pack something warm. Finally, be ready to pay more for accommodation during the winter high season, especially around Christmas and New Year.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:17:\\\"blog_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:2;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:7:\\\"blog_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"it\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translations\\\";s:5:\\\"delay\\\";i:80;}\"}}', 0, NULL, 1753977075, 1753976995);
