(527, 'translations', '{\"uuid\":\"153c70bf-19a0-4c18-9465-156582e086d3\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":null,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":null,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\",\"command\":\"O:28:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\\":8:{s:43:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_name\\\";s:8:\\\"overview\\\";s:53:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000property_new_value_name\\\";s:937:\\\"<p>Begin your day with a warm welcome as you check in to your luxurious Dahabiya in Aswan. Enjoy a leisurely morning, taking in the breathtaking views of the Nile and the surrounding landscapes. After settling in, savor a delicious lunch on board, featuring local flavors and fresh ingredients.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In the afternoon, set sail along the iconic Nile River, immersing yourself in the serene beauty of the surroundings. As you glide through the tranquil waters, take in the sights of charming villages and lush greenery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As evening approaches, return to the Dahabiya for a delightful dinner, where you\'ll enjoy a mix of traditional and contemporary dishes. Wind down your day with a relaxing night onboard in Daraw, surrounded by the peaceful sounds of the river and the starlit sky. This experience promises a blend of adventure, relaxation, and cultural immersion as you journey through Egypt&rsquo;s enchanting landscapes.<\\/p>\\\";s:46:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_name\\\";s:17:\\\"tour_translations\\\";s:50:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_value\\\";i:44;s:49:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000model_table_fk_name\\\";s:7:\\\"tour_id\\\";s:36:\\\"\\u0000App\\\\Jobs\\\\TranslateChangesJob\\u0000locale\\\";s:2:\\\"fr\\\";s:5:\\\"queue\\\";s:12:\\\"translati