(481, 112, 'it', 'Giorno 1: scopri le meraviglie dell\'Egitto', '<p>Pyramids Itenirary Giza, Sakkara e Memphis Full Day Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara e Memphis Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara e Memphis Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Day Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara e Memphis Full Day Piramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day Toursy Pyramids, Sakkara e Memphis Full Day Piramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day Toursy Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara e Memphis Tour per l\'intera giornata</p>'),
