(483, 112, 'es', 'Día 1: Descubre las maravillas de Egipto', '<p>Itenirary Giza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Tourgiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Tour de d&iacute;a completo</p>'),
(484, 112, 'zh', '第1天：发现埃及的奇观', '<p>Itenirary Giza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp; Memphis Full Day TourGiza Pyramids, Sakkara &amp;孟菲斯全日托尔吉萨金字塔，萨克卡拉和孟菲斯全天全天托尔吉萨&middot;金字塔，萨克卡拉和孟菲斯全天候托尔吉萨&middot;托尔吉萨&middot;金字塔，萨克卡拉和孟菲斯全天候托尔吉萨Sakkara＆Memphis全天Tourgiza Pyramids，Sakkara＆Memphis全天Tourgiza Pyramids，Sakkara＆Memphis全天旅行</p>'),
(485, 113, 'en', 'Day 2 • Cairo/Pyramids/Sphinx', '<div class=\"rich-text\">\r\n<p>After breakfast this morning, it&rsquo;s time to tick something huge off your bucket list. Drive out to the edge of the desert and explore the Great Pyramids of Giza &ndash; one of the famed ancient Wonders of the World &ndash; and the nearby Sphinx (nobody\'s quite sure how it lost its nose). A guy called Khufu was responsible for building the Great Pyramid &ndash; it&rsquo;s 4500 years old, 146 m tall, and made from 2.3 million blocks weighing around 2.5 tonnes each. He even got a 9 cm statue to commemorate him &ndash; lucky him! You can marvel at their size up close or take an epic pic from a distance, with Cairo in the background. Later, you&rsquo;ll have free time to continue exploring how you&rsquo;d like &ndash; maybe visit the Egyptian Museum, home to one of the world\'s greatest collections of ancient artefacts, or head to the Valley Temple of King Khafre (Chephren). In the evening, it\'s time for your sleeper train to Aswan where you&rsquo;ll spend the night.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"trip-itinerary-day__meta-data-section u-margin-top--2\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--6-col l-grid__cell--12-col-tablet\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--12-col\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
