(506, 116, 'en', 'Day 5 • Nile Felucca', '<div class=\"rich-text\">\r\n<p>This morning is yours to relax and recharge. Then you&rsquo;ll board an overnight felucca &ndash; a bit like a floating tent, this traditional Egyptian vessel is the perfect way to explore the Nile. Spend the late afternoon amid tranquil scenery, either tucking into a good book or playing cards with your group. Depending on your group&rsquo;s vibe tonight, you might like to have a little beach party under the starry night sky. Tonight, fall asleep to the gentle rocking of the boat, the warm breeze on your cheeks and the blanket of constellations above (there are no walls on a felucca, so your view will be totally undisturbed!).</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"trip-itinerary-day__meta-data-section u-margin-top--2\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--6-col l-grid__cell--12-col-tablet\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--12-col\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
