(527, 119, 'en', 'Day 8 • Cairo', '<div class=\"rich-text\">\r\n<p>When you arrive in Cairo, you&rsquo;ll head to your hotel to freshen up and drop your bags. Then, jump on the Metro with your leader to Bab al-Futuh &ndash; one of three remaining gates from the Old City. Walking past the old Islamic monuments that stand watch over the bazaars, you can join in on some good-natured haggling at the Kahan-el Khalili bazaar, then head to El Fishawy. This ramshackle 240-year-old cafe is perfect for a cup of tea or a glass of cold water with lemon and mint. Tonight, you&rsquo;re free to find the perfect spot for a farewell dinner with your group or to hit the nightlife and celebrate a trip well-travelled.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"trip-itinerary-day__meta-data-section u-margin-top--2\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--6-col l-grid__cell--12-col-tablet\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--12-col\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
