(534, 120, 'en', 'Day 9 • Cairo', '<div class=\"rich-text\">\r\n<p>After breakfast this morning, your trip comes to an end. If you&rsquo;d like to explore Egypt further, just speak to your booking agent ahead of time to organise additional accommodation.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"trip-itinerary-day__meta-data-section u-margin-top--2\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--6-col l-grid__cell--12-col-tablet\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"l-grid__cell l-grid__cell--12-col\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
