(1323, 267, 'en', 'D1 – Arrival Kualanamu – Dewi Kwan Im Statue – Caldera Toba – Parapat (L, D)', '<p data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1535\">Arrival at Kualanamu International Airport. Meet and greet by our representative, then proceed to <strong data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1299\">Pematang Siantar</strong> for local snack shopping (Ting-ting &amp; Teng-teng). Continue to visit the <strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1404\">Giant Statue of Dewi Kwan Im</strong>, followed by <strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1448\">The Caldera Nomadic Escape</strong> overlooking Lake Toba. Continue to <strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1495\">Parapat</strong>, check in hotel, dinner, and overnight.</p>'),
