(1840, 391, 'en', 'Day 1: Aswan', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">We\'ll pick you up on the first day at Aswan airport, the train station, your hotel, or whichever point you would like. Then we\'ll take you to the cruise boat,&nbsp;where your full room and board is waiting for you.&nbsp;We\'ll visit the&nbsp;Temple of Philae&nbsp;</span></p>'),
