(1847, 392, 'en', 'Day 2: Aswan – Kom Ombo – Edfu', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">After breakfast, anyone who wants to can take an&nbsp;optional&nbsp;excursion to the temples of Abu simbel which comes highly recommended.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Then, back on the boat, we\'ll eat and begin to&nbsp;sail along the Nile, arriving at the&nbsp;Kom Ombo Temple at sunset, one of the images of Egypt which will stay with you for life. Then having visited the temple, we\'ll continue sailing towards&nbsp;Edfu, where we\'ll drop anchor to eat dinner and spend the night.</span></p>'),
(1848, 392, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
