(2312, 458, 'it', 'Escursione di snorkeling a Orange Bay con pranzo', '<p>Goditi un\'intera giornata di relax e divertimento sull\'acqua in una delle zone pi&ugrave; belle dei Caraibi egiziani, Orange Bay. Inizia la giornata con il prelievo dal tuo hotel tra le 7:30 e le 8:00 per un trasferimento al porto principale dove le barche ti aspetteranno.<br>Naviga per (45 minuti) in barca verso est di Hurghada , fino a raggiungere il primo posto che in realt&agrave; &egrave; un sito perfetto per fare snorkeling o semplicemente nuotare dove ci sono molte barriere coralline e pesci. Quindi continua a navigare verso Orange Bay. Trascorrerai l&igrave; circa 2 ore per goderti e vedere un\'incredibile spiaggia di sabbia bianca, l\'isola offre tutti i tipi di servizi affidabili per farti sentire a casa e offre un\'area giochi speciale per bambini. Quindi continua a navigare per raggiungere il secondo posto per lo snorkeling dopo esserti rilassato per 2 ore sull\'isola, dove farai una seconda sosta per fare snorkeling o nuotare. Il pranzo sar&agrave; pronto sulla barca prima di effettuare l\'ultima sosta (ogni sosta dura circa 45 minuti). Alla fine della giornata, tornerai al molo di Hurghada (intorno alle 16:00) dove troverai il furgone in attesa di darti un passaggio per tornare al tuo hotel</p>'),
(2313, 458, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2314, 458, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2315, 458, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2316, 459, 'en', 'Day 1 : Cairo – Siwa.', '<p>Ready for Adventure!!! Early morning departure to Siwa Oasis our private limousine to Siwa oasis, The largest (23,000 habitants) &amp; most remote Egyptian Oasis lying some 17m below sea level.</p>\r\n<p>Crossing the Western Desert with a stop in AL alamin 2 world War museum then move to Marsa Matrouh on the Mediterranean Sea for lunch break in one from the local restaurants there after lunch move to Siwa oasis arrive afternoon and overnight in hotel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Meals:</strong>&nbsp;Lunch, Dinner</p>\r\n<p><strong>Accommodation&nbsp;</strong>: Dream Lodge Hotel, Siwa &nbsp;</p>'),
(2317, 459, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(2318, 459, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(2319, 459, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(2320, 459, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2321, 459, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2322, 459, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2323, 460, 'en', 'Day 2 : Siwa local attraction', '<p>After Breakfast start our tour with Shali Old Town. Some buildings here are still in use but due to their construction of salt, mud &amp; plaster they fall into ruin year after year then Following visiting the siwa museum located in a traditional siwan hoaus, the museum boasts traditional siwan objects such as silver, jewellery ,music instrument, wedding costumes , baskets and ceramic.</p>\r\n<p>Then move to Amoun temple (Om Obayda) dates back to the 30th dynasty, and the Oracle Temple where Alexander the Great consulted the oracle to validate his status as the son of Zeus and thus legitimate ruler of the country.</p>\r\n<p>Move to Cleopatra Spring, enjoy the lunch in local cafeteria beside the water spring then Spend today\'s afternoon at Bir Wahed set out 12 km southwest of Siwa.</p>\r\n<p>A hot spring and cold spring at the edge of Great Sand Sea with water right in the middle of the sand dunes and take a mazing sunset from a top of sand dunes , then move to the Bedouin camp for the attractive Bedouin dinner and back to the hotel.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Meals</strong>: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner</p>\r\n<p><strong>Accommodation&nbsp;</strong>: Dream Lodge Hotel, Siwa &nbsp;</p>');
INSERT INTO `tour_day_translations` (`id`, `tour_day_id`, `locale`, `title`, `description`) VALUES
(2324, 461, 'en', 'Day 3 : Siwa – Cairo', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex gap-3\">\r\n<div class=\"border w-full border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 mx-5 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<div class=\"mt-\">\r\n<p>After Breakfast, Departure to Cairo, crossing the Western Desert &amp; back to hotel in Cairo and end the program.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Meals</strong>: Breakfast</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note :</strong></p>\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;if the mentioned hotels or cruises are not available, the company have the right to Change the hotel or Cruise as it of&nbsp;same&nbsp;category&nbsp;.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15357,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:13421772}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:13421772}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:13421772}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:13421772}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;9&quot;:0,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:4408131},&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12}\"