(2703, 516, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2704, 517, 'en', 'Experience the Magic of Luxor’s East Bank', '<p>Rise early for morning tea and coffee before embarking on an adventure to the Temple of Horus in Edfu. Return to the cruise for a hearty breakfast as we sail towards Luxor via Esna. In Luxor, you&rsquo;ll have the opportunity to visit the awe-inspiring Karnak and Luxor Temples on the East Bank. After an afternoon tea on board, enjoy a delectable dinner and a lively Galabeya Party show. Overnight in Luxor, the city of palaces. Meals : breakfast Lunch &amp; Dinner</p>'),
(2705, 517, 'fr', 'Découvrez la magie de la rive est de Louxor', '<p>Levez-vous t&ocirc;t pour prendre le th&eacute; et le caf&eacute; du matin avant de vous lancer dans une aventure au temple d\'Horus &agrave; Edfou. Retour &agrave; la croisi&egrave;re pour un copieux petit-d&eacute;jeuner alors que nous naviguons vers Louxor via Esna. &Agrave; Louxor, vous aurez l&rsquo;occasion de visiter les impressionnants temples de Karnak et de Louxor sur la rive Est. Apr&egrave;s un th&eacute; l\'apr&egrave;s-midi &agrave; bord, savourez un d&eacute;licieux d&icirc;ner et un spectacle anim&eacute; de Galabeya Party. Nuit &agrave; Louxor, la ville des palais. Repas : petit d&eacute;jeuner D&eacute;jeuner &amp; D&icirc;ner</p>'),
(2706, 517, 'de', 'Erleben Sie den Zauber des Ostufers von Luxor', '<p>Stehen Sie fr&uuml;h auf, um morgens Tee und Kaffee zu trinken, bevor Sie sich auf ein Abenteuer zum Tempel des Horus in Edfu begeben. Kehren Sie f&uuml;r ein herzhaftes Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck zur Kreuzfahrt zur&uuml;ck, w&auml;hrend wir &uuml;ber Esna in Richtung Luxor segeln. In Luxor haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, die beeindruckenden Karnak- und Luxor-Tempel am Ostufer zu besichtigen. Genie&szlig;en Sie nach einem Nachmittagstee an Bord ein k&ouml;stliches Abendessen und eine lebhafte Galabeya-Partyshow. &Uuml;bernachtung in Luxor, der Stadt der Pal&auml;ste. Mahlzeiten: Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck, Mittag- und Abendessen</p>'),
(2707, 517, 'it', 'Vivi la magia della sponda orientale di Luxor', '<p>Alzati presto per prendere il t&egrave; e il caff&egrave; mattutino prima di intraprendere un\'avventura al Tempio di Horus a Edfu. Ritorno alla crociera per un\'abbondante colazione mentre navighiamo verso Luxor via Esna. A Luxor avrai l\'opportunit&agrave; di visitare i maestosi templi di Karnak e Luxor sulla sponda orientale. Dopo un t&egrave; pomeridiano a bordo, goditi una cena deliziosa e un vivace spettacolo del Galabeya Party. Pernottamento a Luxor, la citt&agrave; dei palazzi. Pasti: colazione, pranzo e cena</p>'),
(2708, 517, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2709, 517, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2710, 517, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2711, 518, 'en', 'Discover the Wonders of Aswan', '<p>Your adventure begins at Aswan Airport/Railway Station, where our team will greet you and escort you to your Nile Cruise aboard the cruise. Settle into your comfortable cabin before lunch, then prepare to immerse yourself in the rich culture of Aswan. Marvel at the engineering feat of the High Dam, explore the enchanting Philae Temple and witness the grandeur of the unfinished obelisk. As the day winds down, savor a delicious dinner on board and rest up for the next day&rsquo;s adventures in your cozy cabin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meals : Lunch &amp; Dinner</p>'),
(2712, 518, 'fr', 'Découvrez les merveilles d\'Assouan', '<p>Votre aventure commence &agrave; l\'a&eacute;roport/gare d\'Assouan, o&ugrave; notre &eacute;quipe vous accueillera et vous accompagnera jusqu\'&agrave; votre croisi&egrave;re sur le Nil &agrave; bord de la croisi&egrave;re. Installez-vous dans votre cabine confortable avant le d&eacute;jeuner, puis pr&eacute;parez-vous &agrave; vous immerger dans la riche culture d\'Assouan. &Eacute;merveillez-vous devant l\'exploit d\'ing&eacute;nierie du haut barrage, explorez le magnifique temple de Philae et admirez la grandeur de l\'ob&eacute;lisque inachev&eacute;. &Agrave; la fin de la journ&eacute;e, savourez un d&eacute;licieux d&icirc;ner &agrave; bord et reposez-vous pour les aventures du lendemain dans votre cabine confortable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Repas : D&eacute;jeuner et D&icirc;ner</p>'),
(2713, 518, 'de', 'Entdecken Sie die Wunder von Assuan', '<p>Ihr Abenteuer beginnt am Flughafen/Bahnhof Assuan, wo unser Team Sie begr&uuml;&szlig;t und Sie an Bord der Kreuzfahrt zu Ihrer Nilkreuzfahrt begleitet. Machen Sie es sich vor dem Mittagessen in Ihrer komfortablen Kabine gem&uuml;tlich und bereiten Sie sich darauf vor, in die reiche Kultur Assuans einzutauchen. Bewundern Sie die technische Meisterleistung des High Dam, erkunden Sie den bezaubernden Philae-Tempel und werden Sie Zeuge der Pracht des unvollendeten Obelisken. Lassen Sie den Tag ausklingen, genie&szlig;en Sie ein k&ouml;stliches Abendessen an Bord und ruhen Sie sich in Ihrer gem&uuml;tlichen Kabine f&uuml;r die Abenteuer des n&auml;chsten Tages aus.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mahlzeiten: Mittag- und Abendessen</p>'),
(2714, 518, 'it', 'Scopri le meraviglie di Assuan', '<p>La tua avventura inizia all\'aeroporto/stazione ferroviaria di Aswan, dove il nostro team ti accoglier&agrave; e ti accompagner&agrave; alla tua crociera sul Nilo a bordo della crociera. Sistemati nella tua comoda cabina prima di pranzo, quindi preparati a immergerti nella ricca cultura di Assuan. Lasciati stupire dall\'impresa ingegneristica dell\'Alta Diga, esplora l\'incantevole Tempio di Philae e assisti alla grandiosit&agrave; dell\'obelisco incompiuto. Mentre la giornata volge al termine, assapora una deliziosa cena a bordo e riposati per le avventure del giorno successivo nella tua accogliente cabina.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pasti: pranzo e cena</p>'),
(2715, 518, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2716, 518, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2717, 518, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2718, 519, 'en', 'Uncover the Mysteries of Kom Ombo and Edfu', '<p>Awaken to a delicious breakfast on board as we set sail for Kom Ombo. Here, you&rsquo;ll have the chance to explore the unique Temple of Sobek and Haeroris, a testament to the region&rsquo;s ancient religious practices. After a delightful lunch on board, we continue our journey to Edfu. Enjoy a sumptuous dinner on board and rest in the comfort of your cabin in Edfu. Meals : breakfast Lunch &amp; Dinner</p>'),
(2719, 519, 'fr', 'Découvrez les mystères de Kom Ombo et d\'Edfou', '<p>R&eacute;veillez-vous avec un d&eacute;licieux petit-d&eacute;jeuner &agrave; bord alors que nous embarquons pour Kom Ombo. Ici, vous aurez l&rsquo;occasion d&rsquo;explorer le temple unique de Sobek et Haeroris, t&eacute;moignage des anciennes pratiques religieuses de la r&eacute;gion. Apr&egrave;s un d&eacute;licieux d&eacute;jeuner &agrave; bord, nous continuons notre voyage vers Edfou. Profitez d\'un somptueux d&icirc;ner &agrave; bord et reposez-vous dans le confort de votre cabine &agrave; Edfou. Repas : petit d&eacute;jeuner D&eacute;jeuner &amp; D&icirc;ner</p>'),
(2720, 519, 'de', 'Entdecken Sie die Geheimnisse von Kom Ombo und Edfu', '<p>Erwachen Sie mit einem k&ouml;stlichen Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck an Bord, w&auml;hrend wir nach Kom Ombo segeln. Hier haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, den einzigartigen Tempel von Sobek und Haeroris zu erkunden, ein Zeugnis der alten religi&ouml;sen Praktiken der Region. Nach einem k&ouml;stlichen Mittagessen an Bord setzen wir unsere Reise nach Edfu fort. Genie&szlig;en Sie ein &uuml;ppiges Abendessen an Bord und ruhen Sie sich im Komfort Ihrer Kabine in Edfu aus. Mahlzeiten: Fr&uuml;hst&uuml;ck, Mittag- und Abendessen</p>'),
(2721, 519, 'it', 'Scopri i misteri di Kom Ombo e Edfu', '<p>Svegliati con una deliziosa colazione a bordo mentre salpiamo per Kom Ombo. Qui avrai la possibilit&agrave; di esplorare l\'esclusivo Tempio di Sobek e Haeroris, una testimonianza delle antiche pratiche religiose della regione. Dopo un delizioso pranzo a bordo, continuiamo il nostro viaggio verso Edfu. Goditi una sontuosa cena a bordo e riposa nel comfort della tua cabina a Edfu. Pasti: colazione, pranzo e cena</p>'),
(2722, 519, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2723, 519, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2724, 519, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2725, 520, 'en', 'Day 5 : Bahariya Oasis / Cairo', '<div class=\"p-4 bg-[#eeeeee] flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 mx-5 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<div class=\"mt-\">\r\n<p>After having our breakfast in our camp and when we are ready we drive back with our jeep to the oasis where we will find our car ready to drive us back to Cairo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meals: Breakfast</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>If the mentioned cruise or the hotel are not available, the company has the right to change to any cruise or hotel, as long as it is of same category.</p>\r\n<p>That the order of the days could be change according to cruise sailing dates keeping the sightseeing you will visit as it is.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
(2726, 520, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(2727, 520, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(2728, 520, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(2729, 520, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2730, 520, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2731, 520, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2732, 521, 'en', 'Day 4 : White Desert', '<div class=\"p-4 bg-[#eeeeee] flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 mx-5 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<div class=\"mt-\">\r\n<p>Start your adventure visiting white desert national park, we start by the black desert then el hez village and the cold spring ( lunch on the way ) then we drive to visit the crystal mountain and we continue driving to Agapat area, after that we arrive the old white desert ( mushrooms area &amp; tents area ),</p>\r\n<p>Then we visit the new white desert with all the lovely limestone formations when we finish our visit we find a nice place to make our camp for dinner and spending the night under the stars.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
(2733, 521, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(2734, 521, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(2735, 521, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(2736, 521, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2737, 521, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2738, 521, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2739, 522, 'en', 'Day 3 : Siwa – Bahariya', '<p>After Breakfast, crossing the Western Desert, Then move with our AC private car driving around 10 hours towards Bahariya oasis.</p>\r\n<p>Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner</p>'),
(2740, 522, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(2741, 522, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(2742, 522, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(2743, 522, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2744, 522, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2745, 522, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2746, 523, 'en', 'Day 2 : Siwa local attraction', '<p>After Breakfast start our tour with Shali Old Town. Some buildings here are still in use but due to their construction of salt, mud &amp; plaster they fall into ruin year after year then Following visiting the siwa museum located in a traditional siwan hoaus, the museum boasts traditional siwan objects such as silver, jewellery ,music instrument, wedding costumes, baskets and ceramic, then move to Amoun temple (Om Obayda) dates back to the 30th dynasty, and the Oracle Temple where Alexander the Great consulted the oracle to validate his status as the son of Zeus and thus legitimate ruler of the country.</p>\r\n<p>Then move to Cleopatra Spring, enjoy the lunch in local cafeteria beside the water spring then Spend today&rsquo;s afternoon at Bir Wahed set out 12 km southwest of Siwa. A hot spring and cold spring at the edge of Great Sand Sea with water right in the middle of the sand dunes and take a mazing sunset from a top of sand deunes, then move to the Bedouin camp for the attractive Bedouin dinner and back to the hotel.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner</p>'),
(2747, 523, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(2748, 523, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(2749, 523, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(2750, 523, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(2751, 523, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(2752, 523, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(2753, 524, 'en', 'Day 1 : Cairo-Siwa', '<p>Ready for Adventure!!! Early morning departure to Siwa Oasis our private limousine to Siwa oasis , The largest (23,000 habitants) &amp; most remote Egyptian Oasis lying some 17m below sea level. Crossing the Western Desert with a stop in AL alamin 2 world War museum then move to Marsa Matrouh on the Mediterranean Sea for lunch break in one from the local restaurants there after lunch move to Siwa oasis arrive afternoon and overnight in hotel.</p>\r\n<p>Meals: Lunch, Dinner&nbsp;</p>'),
