(3012, 561, 'en', 'Day 11: Private Opening of The Great Pyramid of Giza & Aromatherapy experience', '<p>After breakfast, you will experience an exclusive special private<br>opening of the Great Pyramid of Giza, the only surviving wonder of<br>the ancient world.<br>Next, we will visit a well-known perfumery.<br>Here, drawing on the knowledge of his ancestors, we will<br>be guided through this subject by a certified<br>aromatherapist. Known as \"Healer from the Heart\", he will present a<br>detailed explanation about the physical and psychological uses of<br>the organic essential oils of Egypt. Historically, the beneficial<br>effects of their use has been documented in various papyri of the<br>Ancients. After our essential oil lesson, we return to our hotel.<br>Egygo Travel would like to invite you to the Farewell Dinner.<br>Overnight in Cairo</p>'),
