(3089, 572, 'en', 'Day 3 Private visit to the Great Sphinx and Saqqara complex', '<p>Following breakfast, your Egyptologist guide will pick you<br>for your special private visit to The Great Sphinx, arranged<br>by Egygo\'s experienced Egyptologist, commences by<br>private motor coach to the Giza Plateau. Constructed<br>around 2500BC (Old Kingdom) , the Great Sphinx is a<br>mythical creature with the head of a human and the body<br>of a lion. Facing east, The Great Sphinx greets the morning<br>sun while protecting the Giza pyramids.<br>After that, you will get to visit the Sakkara Complex, which<br>was the main burial area for kings, queens and nobles<br>during the old kingdom, in the same area, you will have the<br>opportunity to visit the Step Pyramid of King Djoser,<br>renowned as the first successful attempt at constructing a<br>standing pyramid 4800 years old</p>'),
(3090, 572, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(3091, 572, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(3092, 572, 'it', NULL, NULL),
