(3152, 581, 'en', 'Itinerary', '<p>We will take you to the Sacred Valley of the Kings, where you will visit its most famous tombs. Then you will head to the great Temple of Hatshepsut, one of the greatest ancient architectures ever built. Its three massive terraces rise above the desert floor and into the cliffs of&nbsp;Deir El-Bahari. Images presented on the walls are of offerings and cult activity, with a painting showing Anubis escorting Hatshepsut to the shrine, and many more historic stories for you to discover. Then you will go to the famous Colossi of Memnon, and the great temple of Habu.</p>\r\n<p>A complimentary visit to the Alabaster Factory will be arranged for you, free of charge, so you can shop for the best Souvenirs to take back home.</p>\r\n<p>Guided by our professional Egyptologists, you will enjoy listening to the Story behind these ancient wonders and have all your inquiries answered with full attention.</p>'),
