(3201, 588, 'en', 'Day 1', '<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Embark on a captivating journey through time with Sun Pyramids Tours as we present our exclusive half-day tour to Islamic Cairo. Our representative, equipped with a modern air-conditioned vehicle, will escort you from your hotel in Cairo to the historic Citadel of Cairo, a fortification from the medieval Islamic era. \\n\\nThis architectural marvel was constructed by Salah ad-Din (Saladin) and has been meticulously preserved and enhanced by successive Egyptian rulers.\\n\\nThe Citadel is home to the renowned Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, also known as the Alabaster Mosque, a must-visit destination in Cairo. Immerse yourself in the spiritual ambiance and marvel at the intricate designs that adorn this sacred place of worship.\\n\\nOur journey continues to the Mosque and Madrasa of Sultan Hassan, a testament to the resilience of the human spirit. Despite the Black Plague that ravaged Cairo in the mid-14th century, this mosque\'s construction began in 1356 CE and stands today as a symbol of perseverance.\\n\\nNext, we visit the Mosque of Al-Refai, a gem of early Mamluk architecture. Constructed between 1356 and 1363 during the Bahri Mamluk period, this mosque is celebrated for its grandeur and innovative architectural elements. It remains one of Cairo\'s most awe-inspiring historic monuments.\\n\\nAs our enriching tour concludes, we ensure a comfortable transfer back to your hotel. With Sun Pyramids Tours, experience the magic of Islamic Cairo, where history comes alive. Join us and create memories that will last a lifetime.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Embark on a captivating journey through time with Pharaoh Vibes Tours as we present our exclusive half-day tour to Islamic Cairo. Our representative, equipped with a modern air-conditioned vehicle, will escort you from your hotel in Cairo to the historic Citadel of Cairo, a fortification from the medieval Islamic era.<br><br>This architectural marvel was constructed by Salah ad-Din (Saladin) and has been meticulously preserved and enhanced by successive Egyptian rulers.<br><br>The Citadel is home to the renowned Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, also known as the Alabaster Mosque, a must-visit destination in Cairo. Immerse yourself in the spiritual ambiance and marvel at the intricate designs that adorn this sacred place of worship.<br><br>Our journey continues to the Mosque and Madrasa of Sultan Hassan, a testament to the resilience of the human spirit. Despite the Black Plague that ravaged Cairo in the mid-14th century, this mosque\'s construction began in 1356 CE and stands today as a symbol of perseverance.<br><br>Next, we visit the Mosque of Al-Refai, a gem of early Mamluk architecture. Constructed between 1356 and 1363 during the Bahri Mamluk period, this mosque is celebrated for its grandeur and innovative architectural elements. It remains one of Cairo\'s most awe-inspiring historic monuments.<br><br>As our enriching tour concludes, we ensure a comfortable transfer back to your hotel. With Pharaoh Vibes Tours, experience the magic of Islamic Cairo, where history comes alive. Join us and create memories that will last a lifetime.</span></p>\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Embark on a captivating journey through time with Sun Pyramids Tours as we present our exclusive half-day tour to Islamic Cairo. Our representative, equipped with a modern air-conditioned vehicle, will escort you from your hotel in Cairo to the historic Citadel of Cairo, a fortification from the medieval Islamic era. \\n\\nThis architectural marvel was constructed by Salah ad-Din (Saladin) and has been meticulously preserved and enhanced by successive Egyptian rulers.\\n\\nThe Citadel is home to the renowned Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, also known as the Alabaster Mosque, a must-visit destination in Cairo. Immerse yourself in the spiritual ambiance and marvel at the intricate designs that adorn this sacred place of worship.\\n\\nOur journey continues to the Mosque and Madrasa of Sultan Hassan, a testament to the resilience of the human spirit. Despite the Black Plague that ravaged Cairo in the mid-14th century, this mosque\'s construction began in 1356 CE and stands today as a symbol of perseverance.\\n\\nNext, we visit the Mosque of Al-Refai, a gem of early Mamluk architecture. Constructed between 1356 and 1363 during the Bahri Mamluk period, this mosque is celebrated for its grandeur and innovative architectural elements. It remains one of Cairo\'s most awe-inspiring historic monuments.\\n\\nAs our enriching tour concludes, we ensure a comfortable transfer back to your hotel. With Sun Pyramids Tours, experience the magic of Islamic Cairo, where history comes alive. Join us and create memories that will last a lifetime.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\"><strong>Note :</strong>&nbsp;For pick up / drop off form Cairo airport, Sphinx airport, New Administrative Capital, New Cairo, Helioplis, Badr City, Shorouk, Rehab, Obour, Sheraton Almatar, Sheikh Zayed city or Madinty City will be for additional cost</span></p>'),
