(3229, 592, 'en', 'Itinerary', '<p>It is a fabulous way to enjoy a night on the Nile while you are in Cairo. So, you are invited to dinner on the Nile cruising restaurant for two hours sailing trip on the Nile with belly dancer, folklore show, Oriental music and dinner. All the time, you&rsquo;ll be delighted in our Chef&rsquo;s menu along with a selection of Egyptian favorites, made with the freshest ingredients, and prepared to make it a memorable dining experience.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>'),
