(3250, 595, 'en', 'Itinerary', '<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"1354\">The Cairo Food Tour typically begins in the late afternoon or early evening with a meet-up in downtown Cairo, where guests are introduced to their guide and fellow participants before heading into vibrant local streets. The tour includes multiple stops at carefully selected food vendors and hidden gems, starting with classic Egyptian street foods like taameya (falafel) and koshary, followed by visits to traditional restaurants for dishes such as grilled meats or shawarma. Along the way, the guide shares stories about Cairo&rsquo;s culinary heritage and local culture, with opportunities to explore markets and bakeries offering fresh bread and pastries. The experience concludes with a sweet finish featuring desserts like basbousa or kunafa, often paired with tea or fresh juice.</p>'),
(3251, 595, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(3252, 595, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(3253, 595, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(3254, 595, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(3255, 595, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(3256, 595, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(3257, 596, 'en', 'Day 1:', '<p><strong>Pharaoh Vibes Tours</strong>&nbsp;representative will pick you up from your&nbsp;<strong>hotel</strong>, in an air-conditioned vehicle to enjoy an excursion to:</p>\r\n<h2><strong>The Grand Egyptian Museum</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM), located near the&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, is a state-of-the-art facility showcasing Egypt&rsquo;s rich history. Set to house over 100,000&nbsp;<strong>artifacts</strong>,The museum blends modern design with ancient heritage, offering interactive exhibits, galleries, and educational spaces.</p>\r\n<p>in this tour we get to see :</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hanging obelisk</li>\r\n<li>King Ramses II statue</li>\r\n<li>10 statues of king Senusert ( Distance view )</li>\r\n<li>Grand staircase ( Distance view )</li>\r\n<li>Ptolemaic king and queen</li>\r\n<li>Victory column of king Merenptah</li>\r\n<li>Royal regalia</li>\r\n<li>Grand atrium &amp; gift shop</li>\r\n<li>Main galleries: Discover Egypt\'s ancient history at&nbsp;<strong>The Grand Egyptian Museum</strong>&rsquo;s Main Galleries, opening on October 16, 2024. With 15,000 artifacts across four sections, explore the rise of early societies, the power of Egypt\'s warrior-kings in the New Kingdom, and the fusion of Egyptian and Greco-Roman cultures in the Ptolemaic era. This remarkable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s dynasties brings the past to life with artifacts reflecting the enduring influence of the gods and beliefs in the afterlife.</li>\r\n<li>After enjoying this tour, you will be dropped off at your hotel by our Modern air- conditioned car</li>\r\n</ul>'),
(3258, 596, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(3259, 596, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(3260, 596, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(3261, 596, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(3262, 596, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(3263, 596, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(3264, 597, 'en', 'Day 1:', '<p>Embark on a magical evening with <span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Sun Pyramids Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Pharaoh Vibes Tours</span> as we transport you from your hotel to the foot of the majestic Giza Pyramids. There, under the stars, you\'ll witness the Sound and Light Show&mdash;a spectacle that brings the legacy of the Pharaohs to life. The night air will fill with tales of the Sphinx, the eternal sentinel of the necropolis, and the grand saga of the pyramids\' construction will unfold before your eyes.<br><br>As the darkness embraces the desert, the Pyramids of Cheops, Chefren, and Mykerinus will light up, narrating the stories of illustrious rulers like Thutmosis IV, the visionary Akhnaten, the revered Nefertiti, and the legendary Tut Ankh Amon. This immersive experience is not just a show; it\'s a journey through time, where history resonates through the voices of the ancients.<br><br>The Sound and Light Show is more than a visual feast; it\'s an educational odyssey that captures the spirit of Ancient Egypt. As the narrative weaves through the epochs, you\'ll feel the presence of the Sphinx, the age-old guardian whose gaze has surveyed the Giza Necropolis for millennia.<br><br>After the echoes of the past have settled, <span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Sun Pyramids Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Pharaoh Vibes Tours</span> will ensure your safe return to the hotel, leaving you with memories that glitter brighter than the constellations above the pyramids. Join us for an evening where history is not just told but spectacularly revealed.</p>'),
(3265, 597, 'fr', NULL, NULL),
(3266, 597, 'de', NULL, NULL),
(3267, 597, 'it', NULL, NULL),
(3268, 597, 'pt', NULL, NULL),
(3269, 597, 'es', NULL, NULL),
(3270, 597, 'zh', NULL, NULL),
(3271, 598, 'en', 'Day 1:', '<p><strong>Pharaoh Vibes Tours</strong>&nbsp;representative will pick you up from your hotel in Cairo or Giza, you&rsquo;ll be taken to the Giza Pyramids. Here, you&rsquo;ll begin an easy ride on a quad bike&mdash;an exhilarating way to explore Egypt&rsquo;s ancient wonders. These custom-built buggies can zip over the sand dunes at speeds of over 50 mph. The thrill of riding through the desert will make your&nbsp;<strong>holiday</strong>&nbsp;in Egypt truly unforgettable. Capture stunning photos and take in the majestic sights of&nbsp;<strong>the Great Pyramid</strong>s: Cheops, Chephren, and Mykerinos.&nbsp; Enjoy the&nbsp;<strong>ATV and Quad bike ride</strong> is an exciting desert trip.</p>'),
