(8, 2, 'en', 'Egypt Adventure', '8 days', 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', '8 am', '<p class=\"lead\" data-cy=\"tagline\"><strong>Trace the pharaohs&rsquo; footsteps and drift down the Nile</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"expandable-section\" data-cy=\"expandable-section\">\r\n<div class=\"expandable-section__body\" data-cy=\"expandable-section-body\">\r\n<div class=\"json-rich-text\" data-cy=\"json-rich-text\">\r\n<p>Journey through Egypt on this eight-day trip and follow the winding path of the river Nile, soaking up Egypt\'s history, beauty and colour. Cruise the longest river in the world on a traditional felucca, discover the largest and most impressive Egyptian temples and share stories with interesting locals over home-cooked meals. Live it up in this country of deserts, bazaars, monuments and unmatched experiences &ndash; and come away with a deeper understanding of how Egypt&rsquo;s past has shaped its future.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<p>HighlightsHighlights</p>', 'Meals 7 breakfasts, 3 lunches, 4 dinners, Felucca,Private vehicle, Overnight sleeper train,Hotel (4 nights),Felucca (1 night)', 'Any optional activities,Tips,International Flight'),
