(112, 34, 'en', 'Eclipse 2027 Program 2  on Land  04 Nights Cairo and Luxor', '5 days 4 nights', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d57517.20954759506!2d32.58216785189068!3d25.710197811359333!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14491599d174b82b%3A0x92db9d280a1b7cd4!2sKarnak%2C%20Luxor%2C%20Luxor%20Governorate!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776693370122!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"753\">Welcome to Egypt&mdash;your journey begins with a warm airport welcome and a smooth transfer to your hotel before experiencing Cairo by night. Explore the wonders of ancient Egypt with visits to the Pyramids of Giza, the Great Sphinx, and the Grand Egyptian Museum. Fly to Luxor to discover the Valley of the Kings, Queen Hatshepsut&rsquo;s temple, and the Colossi of Memnon. The highlight of your adventure is witnessing the Total Solar Eclipse from the majestic Karnak Temple before visiting Luxor Temple. Your unforgettable Egyptian experience concludes with your return flight to Cairo for your final departure.</p>', '<ul data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<li data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"893\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"836\">Cairo by Night</strong> &ndash; A relaxing introduction to Egypt&rsquo;s bustling capital.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"968\"><strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"916\">Pyramids of Giza</strong> &ndash; The last surviving wonder of the ancient world.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<p data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"991\">The Great Sphinx</strong> &ndash; Iconic guardian of the pyramids.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1062\">Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM)</strong> &ndash; Home to 100,000+ artifacts, many displayed for the first time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1189\">Valley of the Kings</strong> &ndash; Includes access to 5 tombs, including Tutankhamun and Ramesses VI.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1358\"><strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1301\">Queen Hatshepsut&rsquo;s Mortuary Temple</strong> &ndash; A unique mountainside temple carved into the cliffs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1452\"><strong data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1382\">Colossi of Memnon</strong> &ndash; Two monumental statues guarding the site of a lost mortuary temple.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1584\"><strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1508\">Karnak Temple</strong> &ndash; Special viewing of the <strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1557\">Total Solar Eclipse</strong> from this grand complex.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1684\"><strong data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1603\">Luxor Temple</strong> &ndash; Featuring the colossal statues of Ramses II and dramatic ancient architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle new models,Representative in airports to assist you through passport control and customs.,Accommodation in hotel Steigenberger El Tahrir or similar in Cairo on BB basis,Accommodation in hotel Steigenberger Nile Palace or similar in Luxor on BB basis,24/7 customer service,Lunch on tours,All domestic flights (CAI-LXR,English speaking Egyptologist guide,Entrance fees,All service charges and taxes', 'Personal Expenses,Optional visits,Tipping,Entry Visa'),
