(126, 36, 'en', 'Mystical Egypt - 12 days', '12 days', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d57524.58457367301!2d32.61826697530811!3d25.694935362507998!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x144915cf52cd95cd%3A0xe0f5dd2b8b1c0e96!2sLuxor%2C%20Luxor%20City%2C%20Luxor%2C%20Luxor%20Governorate!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776694955511!5m2!1sen!2seg\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"701\">This carefully curated Nile Valley journey offers an in-depth exploration of ancient Egypt, combining iconic monuments, expert-guided archaeological visits, and refined cultural experiences. Traveling in the company of an expert Egyptologist, guests will discover some of the best-preserved temples of the ancient world, cruise the Nile aboard a traditional Dahabiya, and enjoy privileged access to sites of exceptional historical importance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"1068\">From the temples of Dendera and Edfu to the royal tombs of Luxor and the monumental splendor of Abu Simbel, this itinerary balances scholarly insight with comfort and exclusivity. The journey concludes in Cairo with a rare private opening of the Great Pyramid, complemented by a sensory introduction to Egypt&rsquo;s ancient healing traditions and a farewell celebration.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1313\"><strong data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1120\">Dendera Temple of Hathor</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1352\">Luxury Nile Sailing by Dahabiya</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1750\"><strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1557\">Karnak Temple Complex</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1958\"><strong data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1777\">Valley of the Kings</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2181\"><strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1991\">Edfu and Kom Ombo Temples</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2377\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2377\"><strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2217\">Philae Temple on Isis Island</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2586\"><strong data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2403\">Abu Simbel Temples</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2806\"><strong data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2640\">Exclusive Private Opening of the Great Pyramid</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"3041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"3041\"><strong data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2846\">Egyptian Aromatherapy Experience</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3194\"><strong data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3073\">Farewell Dinner in Cairo</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Visa fees,All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle,Accommodation in 5* hotels on BB basis in Four,Accommodation in House of Life in Abydos on HB basis,Accommodation on a 5* Dahabiya Kemet or similar on FB basis,Private Opening of The Great Sphinx of Giza,Private Opening of The Osierion,Private Opening of The Great Pyramid of Giza,Domestic Flights,The above mentioned sightseeing tours including English speaking Egyptologist guide,Entrance fees,Water on bus and meals,Lunch on tours,All service charges and taxes', 'Personal Expenses (drinks,Optional excursions,Tipping (Guide and Cruise)'),
