(133, 37, 'en', 'PARAPAT (1 NIGHT) – MEDAN (1 NIGHT)', '2 nights', 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"725\">Discover North Sumatra&rsquo;s iconic destinations in a private tour designed for comfort and cultural immersion. Enjoy the pristine beauty of <strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"599\">Danau Toba</strong>, explore charming Batak villages, experience historic landmarks in Medan, and indulge in local culinary and shopping stops.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"986\">The program is available year-round (normal season), with weekend/high-season surcharges applicable where noted. Tours operate with air-conditioned transportation, experienced local guides, and carefully selected hotels according to your chosen package level.</p>', NULL, 'Hotel accommodation according to selected package (twin/triple share),Daily meals as per itinerary (Halal/Muslim-friendly restaurants),Air-conditioned private transportation (vehicle adjusted to group size),Entrance fees to all listed attractions,Ferry/boat crossings to Samosir (FIT: public ferry / GIT: private boat),Professional local guide (Driver-cum-Guide for FIT / Guide for GIT),Mineral water during tour programs,Welcome snack,FOC 1 pax for every 20 fully paid adults (single room)', 'Air tickets,Porter & excess baggage fees,Travel insurance,Durian Medan (optional),Malay costume rental at Maimun Palace,Tips driver & guide: Rp 20.000/pax/day (payable with tour balance),Weekend surcharges as listed by package'),
