(140, 38, 'en', '2 NIGHTS – SAMOSIR ISLAND', '2 nights', 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"832\">Experience the natural beauty and culture of <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"621\">Danau Toba</strong> with a comprehensive journey through Samosir Island, Parapat, Balige, and Medan. This private tour combines scenic landscapes, Batak heritage, historical museums, local handicrafts, and comfortable hotel stays.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"978\">The tour operates year-round (normal season), with dedicated transportation, licensed guides, and curated dining at Muslim-friendly restaurants.</p>', NULL, 'Hotel accommodation per selected package (twin/triple share),Meals per itinerary (Halal/Muslim restaurants),Private AC transportation (vehicle matched to group size),Entrance fees to listed attractions,Ferry crossings (FIT: public ferry / GIT: charter/private boat),Professional local guide (Driver-cum-Guide for FIT),Mineral water during tours,Welcome snack,FOC 1 pax for every 20 paying adults (single room basis),Child policy: With bed 85% / No bed 65% of adult rate', 'Porter & excess baggage,Airfare,Tips driver & guide: Rp 20.000/pax/day (prepaid with balance),High-season / weekend surcharges where applicable'),
