(275, 70, 'en', 'Sunrise Camel Ride, Pyramids Private Tour & Local Breakfast.', '5 hour', 'private tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110595.93013196797!2d30.98667794335936!3d29.97590020000001!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14584f344cb50ed9%3A0x7fa8297a52c33e07!2sPyramids%20of%20Giza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689881221!5m2!1sen!2seg', 'around 05:00 AM', '<p dir=\"ltr\">Enjoy a private and unmatched day tour to the Giza Pyramids, featuring an early morning Camel ride, followed by an Oriental Egyptian breakfast and a guided tour of the Giza Pyramids Complex.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 'Round-trip pick-up and drop-off from your hotel.,All transfers are in a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Private Egyptologist guide (available in your preferred language).,1-hour Camel Ride Tour around the Giza plateau.,Entrance fees to listed sites (excluding entry to the Great Pyramid interior).,Complimentary bottled water is available in the vehicle.,Breakfast at a local restaurant in Cairo.,All applicable taxes and service charges.', 'Any additional expenses that are not listed in the itinerary.,Tipping.'),
(276, 70, 'es', 'Sunrise Camel Ride, Pirámides Tour privado &amp; Desayuno local.', '5 horas', 'Visita privada', 'diario', 'alrededor de las 05:00 AM', '<p dir=\"ltr\">Disfrute de un tour privado e inigualable a las Pir&aacute;mides Giza, con un paseo temprano por Camel por la ma&ntilde;ana, seguido de un desayuno egipcio oriental y una visita guiada al Complejo de Pir&aacute;mides Giza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Recoger y retirar de su hotel., Todas las transferencias están en un vehículo privado climatizado.,Guía egipcia privada (disponible en su idioma preferido).,1 horas Camel Ride Tour alrededor de la meseta Giza., Entradas a los sitios listados (excluyendo entrada al Gran Pirámide interior)., El vehículo dispone de agua embotellada obligatoria., Desayuno en un restaurante local en El Cairo.,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio aplicables.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier gasto adicional que no figure en el itinerario.,Tipping.</p></body></html>'),
(277, 70, 'fr', 'Sunrise Camel Ride, Pyramides Visite privée et petit déjeuner local.', '5 heures', 'Visite privée', 'tous les jours', 'Vers 05h00', '<p dir=\"ltr\">Profitez d\'une journ&eacute;e priv&eacute;e et in&eacute;gal&eacute;e pour visiter les Pyramides de Giza, avec un tour de chameau t&ocirc;t le matin, suivi d\'un petit d&eacute;jeuner &eacute;gyptien oriental et d\'une visite guid&eacute;e du complexe de Pyramides de Giza.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Ramassage aller-retour et retour de votre hôtel., Tous les transferts sont dans un véhicule climatisé privé.,Guide égyptien privé (disponible dans votre langue préférée).,1 heure Camel Ride Tour autour du plateau de Giza., Frais d\'entrée aux sites énumérés (à l\'exclusion de l\'entrée à l\'intérieur de la grande pyramide). L\'eau en bouteille est disponible gratuitement dans le véhicule., Petit déjeuner dans un restaurant local au Caire.,Toutes les taxes applicables et frais de service.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Toute dépense supplémentaire qui ne sont pas énumérées dans l\'itinéraire.,Tipping.</p></body></html>'),
(278, 70, 'ru', 'Sunrise Camel Ride, Pyramids Private Tour и Local Breakfast.', '5 часов', 'частный тур', 'ежедневно', 'около 05:00 утра', '<html><body><p dir=\"ltr\">Наслаждайтесь частной и непревзойденной дневной экскурсией по пирамидам Гизы, включающей утреннюю поездку на верблюде, а затем восточный египетский завтрак и экскурсию по комплексу пирамид Гизы.</p>\n<p> </p></body></html>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Поездка туда и обратно из вашего отеля. Все трансферы осуществляются в частном кондиционированном транспортном средстве., Частный гид египтолога (доступен на предпочитаемом языке).,1-час Camel Ride Экскурсия по плато Гиза. Входные билеты на перечисленные объекты (за исключением входа в интерьер Великой пирамиды). В транспортном средстве имеется дополнительная бутилированная вода. Завтрак в местном ресторане в Каире, все применимые налоги и сборы за обслуживание.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Любые дополнительные расходы, которые не перечислены в маршруте.</p></body></html>'),
(279, 71, 'en', 'Quad Bike Desert Safari Around Giza Pyramids', 'About 4 Hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110595.02039354856!2d31.11230920340608!3d29.976717303836775!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x145841df75463f89%3A0x5f3b0892d3e82b86!2sQuad%20Bike%20Tours%20Around%20Giza%20Pyramids%20Desert%20Safari%20%7C%20ATV%20%26%20Camel%20Horse%20Rides%20%7C%20Rent%20Beach%20Buggy%20in%20Cairo%20%7C%20Online%20Booking!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689805587!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8:00 AM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Experience the thrill of an&nbsp;<strong>ATV (Quad Bike) Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>, where adventure meets history. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide everything needed for a safe and exhilarating ride, and professional guides. Feel the excitement as you navigate the golden sands surrounding the legendary&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, taking in panoramic views of the ancient wonders and the majestic&nbsp;<strong>Sphinx</strong>.&nbsp;<strong>Book your ATV Quad Bike Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>&nbsp;and make your visit to&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong>&nbsp;unforgettable!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Quad bike (ATV) at Pyramids Of Giza</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">&nbsp;</div>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Riding quad bike for about 01 hour,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,All taxes & service charge.,Private Tour Leader', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.,Tipping.'),
(280, 71, 'es', 'Quad Bike Desert Safari Alrededor de Giza Pirámides', 'Alrededor de 4 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8:00 AM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Experimente la emoci&oacute;n de un<strong>ATV (Quad Bike) Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>, where adventure meets history. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide everything needed for a safe and exhilarating ride, and professional guides. Feel the excitement as you navigate the golden sands surrounding the legendary&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, taking in panoramic views of the ancient wonders and the majestic&nbsp;<strong>Sphinx</strong>.&nbsp;<strong>Book your ATV Quad Bike Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>&nbsp;and make your visit to&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong>&nbsp;unforgettable!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Quad bike (ATV) at Pyramids Of Giza</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">&nbsp;</div>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; regreso. , Bicicleta de cuádruple para aproximadamente 1 hora, Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio., Private Tour Leader</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.</p></body></html>'),
(281, 71, 'fr', 'Quad Bike Desert Safari autour de Giza Pyramides', 'Environ 4 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8h00', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Exp&eacute;rimentez le frisson d\'un<strong>ATV (Quad Bike) Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>, where adventure meets history. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide everything needed for a safe and exhilarating ride, and professional guides. Feel the excitement as you navigate the golden sands surrounding the legendary&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, taking in panoramic views of the ancient wonders and the majestic&nbsp;<strong>Sphinx</strong>.&nbsp;<strong>Book your ATV Quad Bike Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>&nbsp;and make your visit to&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong>&nbsp;unforgettable!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Quad v&eacute;lo (VTT) &agrave; Pyramides de Giza</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">&nbsp;</div>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel et retour. ,Riding quad vélo pendant environ 01 heures, frais d\'entrée à tous les sites mentionnés., Toutes taxes et frais de service, Chef de voyage privé</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire.,Tipping.</p></body></html>'),
(282, 71, 'ru', 'Пустынное сафари вокруг пирамид Гизы', 'Около 4 часов', 'Частный тур', 'Каждый день', '8:00', '<html><body><section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\n<p>Почувствуйте острые ощущения от<strong>ATV (Quad Bike) Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong>, where adventure meets history. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide everything needed for a safe and exhilarating ride, and professional guides. Feel the excitement as you navigate the golden sands surrounding the legendary <strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, taking in panoramic views of the ancient wonders and the majestic <strong>Sphinx</strong>. <strong>Book your ATV Quad Bike Tour at the Pyramids Desert</strong> and make your visit to <strong>Cairo</strong> unforgettable!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"> </div>\n</section>\n</div></body></html>', '<html><body><div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Квадроцикл (ATV) в Пирамидах Гизы</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-12\"> </div></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Все трансферы частным кондиционированным транспортным средством. Выберите услуги из отеля и вернитесь. Прокат квадроцикла около 01 часа, входные билеты на все упомянутые сайты. Все налоги и сборы за обслуживание, Частный тур Лидер</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Любые дополнения, не упомянутые в маршруте.</p></body></html>'),
(283, 72, 'en', 'Giza Pyramids Sound and Light Show', '4 Hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d7078232.521199001!2d21.910914375!3d29.974595100000016!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14584f00554da29f%3A0x61e5088b31804b1b!2sGiza%20Pyramids%20Sound%20%26%20Light%20Show!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689740463!5m2!1sen!2seg', '6:30 PM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Sun Pyramids Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Pharaoh Vibes Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Sound and light at Giza Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">&nbsp;</div>', 'An open buffet dinner with a variety of dishes and selected drinks,Non-stop live entertainment (Tanora dance, tabla performance, live jazz, fire show, LED display),Professional event host,Taxes and service charges', 'Transportation to and from the venue (available as an optional add-on),Personal expenses and tips,Drinks and beverages not specified in the package,Any services not mentioned in the “Includes” section'),
(284, 72, 'es', 'Giza Pyramids Sound and Light Show', '4 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Miércoles a sábado', '6:30 PM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Sun Pyramids Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!&quot;}\">Experimente la grandeza de las pir&aacute;mides Giza bajo las estrellas con Faraon Vibes Tours. La historia de los testigos cobra vida en el Sound &amp;amp; Light Show, donde los cuentos de Egipto hacen eco a trav&eacute;s de las edades. &iexcl;Una noche de maravilla espera!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Sonido y luz en las pir&aacute;mides de Giza</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">&nbsp;</div>', '<html><body><p>Una cena de buffet abierta con una variedad de platos y bebidas seleccionadas,Entretenimiento en vivo sin parar (Danza de verano, tabla performance, jazz en vivo, espectáculo de incendios, pantalla LED),Alojamiento profesional de eventos,Taxes y cargos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Transporte a y desde el lugar (disponible como complemento opcional), gastos y consejos personales,Bebidas y bebidas no especificadas en el paquete,Cualquier servicio no mencionado en la sección “Incluye”</p></body></html>'),
(285, 72, 'fr', 'Giza Pyramides Sound and Light Show', '4 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Du mercredi au samedi', '18 h 30', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Sun Pyramids Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!&quot;}\">Vivez la grandeur de Giza Pyramides sous les &eacute;toiles avec Pharaon Vibes Tours. L\'histoire des t&eacute;moins est vivante au Sound &amp; Light Show, o&ugrave; les contes &eacute;gyptiens r&eacute;sonnent &agrave; travers les &acirc;ges. Une nuit d\'&eacute;merveillement vous attend !</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Son et lumi&egrave;re &agrave; Giza Pyramides</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">&nbsp;</div>', '<html><body><p>Un dîner buffet ouvert avec une variété de plats et de boissons sélectionnées,Divertissement en direct non-stop (danse de Tanora, performance tabla, jazz live, feu, affichage LED),Hébergeur professionnel d\'événements,Taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Transport à destination et en provenance du lieu (disponible en option),Dépenses personnelles et conseils,Boissons et boissons non spécifiées dans le forfait,Tous les services non mentionnés dans la section .</p></body></html>'),
(286, 72, 'ru', 'Пирамиды Гизы Звуковое и световое шоу', '4 часа', 'Частный тур', 'Среда - суббота', '6:30 вечера', '<html><body><section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-userformat=\'{\"2\":9153,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"9\":1,\"10\":1,\"11\":4,\"12\":0,\"16\":12}\' data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Experience the Giza Pyramids\' grandeur under the stars with Sun Pyramids Tours. Witness history come alive at the Sound &amp; Light Show, where Egypt\'s tales echo through ages. A night of wonder awaits!&quot;}\">Ощутите величие пирамид Гизы под звездами с турами фараона Вибеса. История Свидетелей оживает на Шоу звука и света, где истории Египта эхом перекликаются через века. Ночь чудес ждет!</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section></body></html>', '<html><body><div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Звук и свет в пирамидах Гизы</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-12\"> </div></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Открытый ужин в буфете с различными блюдами и выбранными напитками, безостановочные живые развлечения (танец танора, выступление табла, живой джаз, огненное шоу, светодиодный дисплей), профессиональный хозяин мероприятия, налоги и сервисные сборы</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Транспортировка в и из места проведения (доступно в качестве дополнительного дополнения), личные расходы и чаевые, напитки и напитки, не указанные в упаковке, любые услуги, не упомянутые в разделе «Включает»</p></body></html>'),
(287, 73, 'en', '4 Days Siwa & White Desert Tour – Temples, Springs & Desert Camping.', '4 Days / 3 Night', 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', 'Upon your Arrival', '<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Embark on a 4-day thrilling adventure from Cairo to the African Sahara, exploring the untouched paradise of the Siwa Oasis, one of the world\'s most isolated ecosystems. Discover the Bahraya Oasis, and the White Desert, renowned for its otherworldly rock formations and mountains of crystal. Unwind in the healing hot and cold springs, approach the Amazigh ethnic culture and explore World War II sites at Alamein. Ideal for camping &amp; stargazing fans.</span></p>', '', 'Pick up services from hotel in Cairo & return,All sightseeing tours mentioned in the itinerary,All transfers from Cairo to Siwa and From Bahariya to Cairo by an A/C vehicle,All transfers inside Siwa & White Desert by 4x4 car,Entrance fees to the mentioned sightseeing,Camping equipment like sleeping bags,camel blanket & tents.,Breakfast and dinner are included at the hotel,Bottled Water & Soft drinks during camping in the desert,Accommodation as mentioned on the itinerary,All Taxes & Service Charge.,Private Tour Leader', 'Any extras not mentioned in the program,Tipping Kitty,Personal expenses,Optional activities,Beverages'),
(288, 73, 'es', '4 Días Siwa &amp; White Desert Tour – Temples, Springs & Desert Camping.', '4 Días / 3 noches', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', 'En tu llegada', '<html><body><p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Embarca en una emocionante aventura de 4 días desde El Cairo al Sahara Africano, explorando el paraíso intacto de la Siwa Oasis, uno de los ecosistemas más aislados del mundo. Descubre el Oasis Bahraya y el Desierto Blanco, famoso por sus formaciones rocosas y montañas de cristal. Descansar en las aguas termales y frías, acercarse a la cultura étnica amazigh y explorar los sitios de la Segunda Guerra Mundial en Alamein. Ideal para acampar &amp;quot; fanáticos hambrientos.</span></p></body></html>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Recogida de los servicios desde el hotel en El Cairo &amp;quot; regreso,Todas las visitas turísticas mencionadas en el itinerario,Todas las transferencias desde El Cairo a Siwa y Desde Bahariya a El Cairo por un vehículo A/C,Todas las transferencias dentro de Siwa &amp;amp; White Desert en 4x4 coche,Precios de entrada a la mencionada visita turística,Equipos de camping como sacos de dormir, carpas de manta &amp;quot; , El desayuno y la cena se incluyen en el hotel, Agua embotellada &amp;quot; Bebidas suaves durante el camping en el desierto, Alojamiento como se menciona en el itinerario,Todas las tarifas &amp;quot; . Private Tour Leader</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el programa,Tipping Kitty, Gastos personales,Actividades opcionales,Varios</p></body></html>'),
(289, 73, 'fr', '4 Jours Siwa & White Desert Tour – Temples, Springs & Desert Camping.', '4 jours / 3 nuits', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', 'À votre arrivée', '<html><body><p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Embarquez pour une aventure palpitante de 4 jours du Caire au Sahara africain, explorant le paradis intact de l\'Oasis Siwa, l\'un des écosystèmes les plus isolés du monde. Découvrez l\'Oasis de Bahraya et le désert blanc, réputés pour ses formations rocheuses et ses montagnes de cristal. Détendez-vous dans les sources chaudes et froides de guérison, approchez de la culture ethnique amazighe et explorez les sites de la Seconde Guerre mondiale à Alamein. Idéal pour les amateurs de camping et de surveillance des étoiles.</span></p></body></html>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Services de ramassage de l\'hôtel au Caire &amp; retour,Toutes les visites touristiques mentionnées dans l\'itinéraire,Tous les transferts du Caire à Siwa et De Bahariya au Caire par un véhicule A/C,Tous les transferts à l\'intérieur de Siwa &amp; White Desert par 4x4 voiture,Les frais d\'entrée à la visite mentionnée,L\'équipement de camping comme les sacs de couchage, couverture camel &amp; tentes., Le petit déjeuner et le dîner sont inclus à l\'hôtel,Eau bouchée &amp; boissons gazeuses pendant le camping dans le désert,Logis comme mentionné sur l\'itinéraire,Toutes taxes et frais de service., Chef de voyage privé</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les suppléments non mentionnés dans le programme,Tiping Kitty,Dépenses personnelles,Activités facultatives,Beverages</p></body></html>'),
(290, 73, 'ru', '4 Days Siwa & White Desert Tour: Temples, Springs & Desert Camping', '4 дня / 3 ночи', 'Частный тур', 'Каждый день', 'После вашего прибытия', '<html><body><p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\">Отправляйтесь в 4-дневное захватывающее приключение из Каира в африканскую Сахару, исследуя нетронутый рай оазиса Сива, одной из самых изолированных экосистем в мире. Откройте для себя оазис Бахрая и Белую пустыню, известную своими потусторонними скальными образованиями и горами из хрусталя. Отдохните в целебных горячих и холодных источниках, подойдите к этнической культуре амазигов и исследуйте места Второй мировой войны в Аламейне. Идеально подходит для кемпинга и фанатов.</span></p></body></html>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Все экскурсии, упомянутые в маршруте, все трансферы из Каира в Сиву и из Бахарии в Каир на автомобиле A / C, все трансферы внутри Сивы и Белой пустыни на автомобиле 4x4, входные билеты на упомянутый осмотр достопримечательностей, оборудование для кемпинга, такое как спальные мешки, одеяло и палатки. Завтрак и ужин включены в отеле, Бутилированная вода и безалкогольные напитки во время кемпинга в пустыне, Проживание, как указано в маршруте, Все налоги и плата за обслуживание. Частный тур Лидер</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Любые дополнительные услуги, не упомянутые в программе, Типпинг Китти, Личные расходы, Дополнительные мероприятия, Напитки</p></body></html>'),
(291, 74, 'en', 'Giza Pyramids & the Grand Egyptian Museum', 'About 8 Hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3455.5208077585216!2d31.12186597468025!3d29.99319857494939!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14584534984a8ad1%3A0x45764c5bc4ec261a!2sThe%20Grand%20Egyptian%20Museum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776688869548!5m2!1sen!2seg', 'Pick-up Time: 08:00 AM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Visit the Giza Pyramids and Grand Egyptian Museum outside of Cairo to see the world largest collection of Egyptian antiquities on a private tour with entry, hotel transfers, and guide.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pyramids Complex</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pyramids</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM)\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pickup and drop-off service,Transportation by an air-conditioned vehicle,Entry fee,Lunch,Shopping tour in cairo.,Private tour guide,All Taxes & Service Charge.', 'Any additional expenses that are not listed in the itinerary.,Tipping.,Tickets To Get Inside The Pyramids'),
(292, 74, 'es', 'Giza Pirámides &quot; el Gran Museo Egipcio', 'Alrededor de 8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', 'Tiempo de recogida: 08:00 AM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Visite las pir&aacute;mides de Giza y el Gran Museo egipcio fuera de El Cairo para ver la colecci&oacute;n m&aacute;s grande del mundo de antig&uuml;edades egipcias en un tour privado con entrada, traslados de hotel y gu&iacute;a.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Complejo de pir&aacute;mides Giza</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pyramids</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM)\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Servicio de recogida y entrega,Transporte por vehículo climatizado,Pago de entrada,Almuerzo,Pasaje en cairo., Guía de viaje privado,Todos los impuestos y carga de servicio.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier gasto adicional que no figure en el itinerario.,Tipping.,Tickets To Get Inside Las pirámides</p></body></html>'),
(293, 74, 'fr', 'Giza Pyramides et le Grand Musée égyptien', 'Environ 8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', 'Heure de ramassage: 08:00', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Visitez les Pyramides de Giza et le Grand Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien &agrave; l\'ext&eacute;rieur du Caire pour voir la plus grande collection mondiale d\'antiquit&eacute;s &eacute;gyptiennes sur une visite priv&eacute;e avec entr&eacute;e, transferts d\'h&ocirc;tel, et guide.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Complexe de pyramides de Giza</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pyramids</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM)\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Service de ramassage et de dépose,Transport par un véhicule climatisé,Frais d\'entrée,Lunch,Visite shopping au Caire.,Guide privé,Toutes taxes et frais de service.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Toutes les dépenses supplémentaires qui ne sont pas énumérées dans l\'itinéraire.,Tipping.,Tickets pour entrer Les pyramides</p></body></html>'),
(294, 74, 'ru', 'Пирамиды Гизы и Большой Египетский музей', 'Около 8 часов', 'Частный тур', 'Каждый день', 'Время пикапа: 08:00', '<html><body><section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\n<p>Посетите пирамиды Гизы и Большой Египетский музей за пределами Каира, чтобы увидеть самую большую в мире коллекцию египетских древностей в частном туре с входом, трансферами из отеля и гидом.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section></body></html>', '<html><body><ul>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Комплекс пирамид Гизы</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pyramids</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM)\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"> </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Услуги по сбору и высадке, Транспортировка на кондиционированном транспортном средстве, Входная плата, Обед, Шоппинг-тур в Каире., Частный гид, Все налоги и плата за обслуживание.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Любые дополнительные расходы, которые не указаны в маршруте., Типпинг., Тикеты, чтобы попасть внутрь Пирамиды</p></body></html>'),
(295, 75, 'en', 'Full Day Tour To Giza Pyramids, Memphis, Sakkara and Dahshur', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3456.0742463292618!2d31.129920575551107!3d29.977296174957395!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14584f7de239bbcd%3A0xca7474355a6e368b!2sGiza%20Necropolis!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776688794784!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><strong>Full Day Tour to Giza Pyramids, Memphis, Sakkara, and Dahshur</strong> will take you on an unforgettable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic ancient sites. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide all our guests with top-notch services, including a private A/C vehicle and a professional Egyptologist tour guide, ensuring a seamless and enriching experience. Start your adventure at the majestic <strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, where you&rsquo;ll marvel at the grandeur of&nbsp;<strong>the Great Pyramid</strong>&nbsp;and the enigmatic Sphinx. Next, travel to the ancient capital of&nbsp;<strong>Memphis</strong>&nbsp;to explore the ruins and the colossal statue of Ramses II. Continue to Sakkara to witness&nbsp;<strong>the step pyramid</strong>&nbsp;of Djoser, the earliest colossal stone building in history. Finally, visit Dahshur, home to&nbsp;<strong>the Bent Pyramid</strong>&nbsp;and the Red Pyramid, where you&rsquo;ll discover the evolution of pyramid construction. Experience the wonders of ancient Egypt by booking this incredible&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids, Memphis, Sakkara and Dahshur day tour</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pyramids</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saqqara Step Pyramid</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Lunch meal will be served in a local restaurant.,Bottled water during your trip.,Shopping tours in Cairo.,All taxes & service charge.,Private Tour Guide', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.,Tipping.,Tickets to get inside the Pyramids');
INSERT INTO `tour_translations` (`id`, `tour_id`, `locale`, `title`, `duration`, `type`, `run`, `pickup_time`, `overview`, `highlights`, `included`, `excluded`) VALUES
(296, 75, 'es', 'Viaje de día completo a las pirámides de Giza, Memphis, Sakkara y Dahshur', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><strong>Viaje de d&iacute;a completo a Giza Pir&aacute;mides, Memphis, Sakkara y Dahshur</strong> will take you on an unforgettable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic ancient sites. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide all our guests with top-notch services, including a private A/C vehicle and a professional Egyptologist tour guide, ensuring a seamless and enriching experience. Start your adventure at the majestic <strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, where you&rsquo;ll marvel at the grandeur of&nbsp;<strong>the Great Pyramid</strong>&nbsp;and the enigmatic Sphinx. Next, travel to the ancient capital of&nbsp;<strong>Memphis</strong>&nbsp;to explore the ruins and the colossal statue of Ramses II. Continue to Sakkara to witness&nbsp;<strong>the step pyramid</strong>&nbsp;of Djoser, the earliest colossal stone building in history. Finally, visit Dahshur, home to&nbsp;<strong>the Bent Pyramid</strong>&nbsp;and the Red Pyramid, where you&rsquo;ll discover the evolution of pyramid construction. Experience the wonders of ancient Egypt by booking this incredible&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids, Memphis, Sakkara and Dahshur day tour</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Giza Pir&aacute;mides</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saqqara Step Pyramid</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., La comida se sirve en un restaurante local., Agua embotellada durante su viaje., Viajes de compras en El Cairo.,Todos los impuestos y cargo de servicio., Guía del Tour Privado</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.,Tipping.,Tickets para entrar en las pirámides</p></body></html>'),
(297, 75, 'fr', 'Visite d\'une journée complète à Giza Pyramides, Memphis, Sakkara et Dahshur', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><strong>Visite d\'une journ&eacute;e compl&egrave;te &agrave; Giza Pyramides, Memphis, Sakkara et Dahshur</strong> will take you on an unforgettable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic ancient sites. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide all our guests with top-notch services, including a private A/C vehicle and a professional Egyptologist tour guide, ensuring a seamless and enriching experience. Start your adventure at the majestic <strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, where you&rsquo;ll marvel at the grandeur of&nbsp;<strong>the Great Pyramid</strong>&nbsp;and the enigmatic Sphinx. Next, travel to the ancient capital of&nbsp;<strong>Memphis</strong>&nbsp;to explore the ruins and the colossal statue of Ramses II. Continue to Sakkara to witness&nbsp;<strong>the step pyramid</strong>&nbsp;of Djoser, the earliest colossal stone building in history. Finally, visit Dahshur, home to&nbsp;<strong>the Bent Pyramid</strong>&nbsp;and the Red Pyramid, where you&rsquo;ll discover the evolution of pyramid construction. Experience the wonders of ancient Egypt by booking this incredible&nbsp;<strong>Giza Pyramids, Memphis, Sakkara and Dahshur day tour</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Pyramides de Giza</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saqqara Step Pyramid</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Le déjeuner sera servi dans un restaurant local. Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage., Circuits commerciaux au Caire.,Toutes taxes et frais de service., Guide touristique privé</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire.,Tipping.,Tickets pour entrer dans les pyramides</p></body></html>'),
(298, 75, 'ru', 'Экскурсия на целый день по пирамидам Гизы, Мемфису, Саккаре и Дахшуру', '8 часов', 'Частный тур', 'Каждый день', '8 утра', '<html><body><section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\n<p><strong>Экскурсия на весь день по пирамидам Гизы, Мемфису, Саккаре и Дахшуру</strong> will take you on an unforgettable journey through Egypt’s most iconic ancient sites. Pharaoh Vibes Tours will provide all our guests with top-notch services, including a private A/C vehicle and a professional Egyptologist tour guide, ensuring a seamless and enriching experience. Start your adventure at the majestic <strong>Giza Pyramids</strong>, where you’ll marvel at the grandeur of <strong>the Great Pyramid</strong> and the enigmatic Sphinx. Next, travel to the ancient capital of <strong>Memphis</strong> to explore the ruins and the colossal statue of Ramses II. Continue to Sakkara to witness <strong>the step pyramid</strong> of Djoser, the earliest colossal stone building in history. Finally, visit Dahshur, home to <strong>the Bent Pyramid</strong> and the Red Pyramid, where you’ll discover the evolution of pyramid construction. Experience the wonders of ancient Egypt by booking this incredible <strong>Giza Pyramids, Memphis, Sakkara and Dahshur day tour</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"> </div>\n</section>\n</div></body></html>', '<html><body><ul>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Пирамиды Гизы</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Great Sphinx</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Valley Temple</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saqqara Step Pyramid</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\n</ul></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Все трансферы частным кондиционированным транспортным средством. Выберите услуги из отеля и вернитесь. Входные билеты на все упомянутые сайты. Обед будет подаваться в местном ресторане. Вода в бутылках во время путешествия. Торговые туры в Каир., Все налоги и сборы за обслуживание. Частный тур гид</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Любые дополнения, не упомянутые в маршруте., Типпинг., Тикетс, чтобы попасть внутрь пирамид</p></body></html>'),
(299, 76, 'en', 'Sakkara, Memphis and Dahshur', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3459.8547542069336!2d31.219399525325635!3d29.868462375012662!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14584bd4cd4a2873%3A0xe08c36415baeee76!2z2YXZhti32YLYqSDYotir2KfYsSDYs9mC2KfYsdip!5e0!3m2!1sar!2seg!4v1776688719892!5m2!1sar!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>From the Step Pyramid of Zoser to the Red and Bent Pyramids of Dahshur, and the ancient city of Memphis, experience history\'s grandeur in a day with <strong>Pharaoh Vibes Tours</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saqqara Step Pyramid</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Lunch meal will be served in a local restaurant.,Bottled water during your trip.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Private tour guide,Shopping tour in Cairo.,All taxes & service charge.', 'Tipping.,Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.'),
(300, 76, 'es', 'Sakkara, Memphis y Dahshur', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Desde el Paso Pir&aacute;mide de Zoser a las Pir&aacute;mides Rojas y Bent de Dahshur, y la antigua ciudad de Memphis, experimentar la grandeza de la historia en un d&iacute;a con<strong>Pharaoh Vibes Tours</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saqqara Step Pyramid</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., La comida se sirve en un restaurante local., Agua embotellada durante su viaje., Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., Guía de viaje privado, tour de compras en El Cairo., Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tipping, Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.</p></body></html>'),
(301, 76, 'fr', 'Sakkara, Memphis et Dahshur', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>De la Pyramide Step de Zoser aux Pyramides Rouges et Bent de Dahshur, et l\'ancienne ville de Memphis, d&eacute;couvrez la grandeur de l\'histoire en une journ&eacute;e avec<strong>Pharaoh Vibes Tours</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Pyramide &eacute;tape Saqqara</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Le déjeuner sera servi dans un restaurant local. Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Guide privé, Visite shopping au Caire., Toutes taxes et frais de service.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Un coup. Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire.</p></body></html>'),
(302, 76, 'ru', 'Саккара, Мемфис и Дахшур', '8 часов', 'Частный тур', 'Каждый день', '8 утра', '<html><body><section>\n<div class=\"my-12\">\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\n<p>От ступенчатой пирамиды Зозера до красных и изогнутых пирамид Дахшура и древнего города Мемфис, испытайте величие истории за один день с<strong>Pharaoh Vibes Tours</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section></body></html>', '<html><body><ul>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Ступенчатая пирамида Саккара</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Memphis City</li>\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dahshur Pyramids</li>\n</ul></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Все трансферы частным кондиционированным транспортным средством. Обед будет подаваться в местном ресторане. Вода в бутылках во время путешествия. Входные билеты на все упомянутые сайты. Частный гид, Шопинг-тур в Каире. Все налоги и сервисные сборы.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Чаевые. Любые дополнения, не упомянутые в маршруте.</p></body></html>'),
(303, 77, 'en', 'Egyptian Museum, Citadel and Khan Khalili Bazaar', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110544.96033034885!2d31.10863285562716!3d30.02164888060297!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1458b14d72adf029%3A0x9a38f9bbb6edbfe4!2sThe%20Egyptian%20Museum%20in%20Cairo!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689561038!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>Cairo Day Tour to the Egyptian Museum, Citadel, and Khan Khalili Bazaar offers an incredible journey through the heart of Egypt\'s rich history and vibrant culture. Sun Pyramids Tours will provide all our guests with exceptional services, including a private A/C vehicle and a professional Egyptologist tour guide to ensure a memorable experience. Begin your adventure at the Egyptian Museum, home to thousands of ancient artifacts, where you\'ll dive deep into Egypt\'s fascinating past. Next, visit the historic Citadel of Salah El Din, where you can explore the magnificent Mosque of Mohamed Ali and enjoy breathtaking views of Cairo. End your day at the bustling Khan Khalili Bazaar, where you can shop for unique souvenirs, experience traditional Egyptian hospitality, and soak in the lively atmosphere. Discover the magic of Cairo by booking A Egyptian Museum, Citadel and Khan Khalili Bazaar day tour.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Egyptian Museum</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Lunch meal will be served in a local restaurant.,Bottled water during your trip.,Shopping tours in Cairo.,Private Tour Guide,All taxes & service charge.', 'Tips,Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.'),
(304, 77, 'es', 'Museo egipcio, Ciudadela y Khan Khalili Bazaar', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>El Cairo Day Tour al Museo egipcio, Citadel y Khan Khalili Bazaar ofrece un viaje incre&iacute;ble a trav&eacute;s del coraz&oacute;n de la rica historia y la cultura vibrante de Egipto. Pir&aacute;mides del Sol Tours proporcionar&aacute; a todos nuestros hu&eacute;spedes servicios excepcionales, incluyendo un veh&iacute;culo A/C privado y una gu&iacute;a profesional de la gira de Egipto para garantizar una experiencia inolvidable. Comience su aventura en el Museo egipcio, hogar de miles de artefactos antiguos, donde se sumergir&aacute; profundamente en el fascinante pasado de Egipto. A continuaci&oacute;n, visite la hist&oacute;rica Ciudadela de Salah El Din, donde se puede explorar la magn&iacute;fica mezquita de Mohamed Ali yenjoy impresionantes vistas de El Cairo. Finaliza tu d&iacute;a en el bullicioso Khan Khalili Bazaar, donde podr&aacute;s comprar recuerdos &uacute;nicos, experimentar la hospitalidad egipcia tradicional, y remojarte en el ambiente animado. Descubra la magia de El Cairo mediante la reserva Un Museo Egipcio, Ciudadela y Khan Khalilili Bazaar d&iacute;a gira.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">El Museo egipcio</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., La comida se sirve en un restaurante local., Agua embotellada durante su viaje., Visitas de compras en El Cairo., Guía de Tour Privado,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Consejos,Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.</p></body></html>'),
(305, 77, 'fr', 'Musée égyptien, Citadelle et Khan Khalili Bazaar', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>Visite de la journ&eacute;e du Caire au Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien, Citadel, et Khan Khalili Bazaar offre un voyage incroyable &agrave; travers le c&oelig;ur de la riche histoire de l\'Egypte et de la culture vibrante. Pyramides solaires Tours fournira &agrave; tous nos clients des services exceptionnels, y compris un v&eacute;hicule priv&eacute; A / C et un guide de visite &eacute;gyptologue professionnel pour assurer une exp&eacute;rience m&eacute;morable. Commencez votre aventure au Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien, qui abrite des milliers d\'objets anciens, o&ugrave; vous plongerez au fond du pass&eacute; fascinant de l\'&Eacute;gypte. Ensuite, visitez la citadelle historique de Salah El Din, o&ugrave; vous pourrez explorer la magnifique mosqu&eacute;e de Mohamed Ali et profiter d\'une vue imprenable sur le Caire. Finissez votre journ&eacute;e au khan Khalili Bazaar, o&ugrave; vous pourrez acheter des souvenirs uniques, vivre l\'hospitalit&eacute; traditionnelle &eacute;gyptienne et vous impr&eacute;gner de l\'atmosph&egrave;re anim&eacute;e. D&eacute;couvrez la magie du Caire en r&eacute;servant une visite d\'une journ&eacute;e au Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien, &agrave; la Citadelle et &agrave; Khan Khalili Bazaar.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Le Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Le déjeuner sera servi dans un restaurant local. Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage., Shopping au Caire.,Guide touristique privé,Toutes taxes et frais de service.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Conseils,Tout extra non mentionné dans l\'itinéraire.</p></body></html>'),
(306, 78, 'en', 'National Museum, Citadel, Coptic Cairo And Bazaar Tour', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13819.939370280243!2d31.22978527264242!3d30.008591612920107!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1458476863e39e8f%3A0xc2e058446f8f145d!2sThe%20National%20Museum%20of%20Egyptian%20Civilization!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689312200!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Experience Egyptian culture at the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization. Enjoy shopping at Khan El-Khalili Bazaar and taste Egyptian flavors at a local restaurant.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">National Museum of Egyptian Civilization (NMEC)</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Lunch meal will be served in a local restaurant.,Bottled water during your trip.,Private Tour Guide,Shopping tour in cairo', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.,Tips'),
(307, 78, 'es', 'National Museum, Citadel, Coptic Cairo And Bazaar Tour', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Experimenta la cultura egipcia en el Museo Nacional de la Civilizaci&oacute;n Egipcia. Disfrute de las compras en Khan El-Khalili Bazaar y saboree los sabores egipcios en un restaurante local.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">National Museum of Egyptian Civilization (NMEC)</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., La comida se sirve en un restaurante local., Agua embotellada durante su viaje., Guía de Tour Privado, Paseos en cairo</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario., Consejos</p></body></html>'),
(308, 78, 'fr', 'Musée national, Citadelle, Visite copte du Caire et du Bazar', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>D&eacute;couvrez la culture &eacute;gyptienne au Mus&eacute;e national de la civilisation &eacute;gyptienne. Profitez du shopping &agrave; Khan El-Khalili Bazaar et go&ucirc;tez aux saveurs &eacute;gyptiennes dans un restaurant local.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mus&eacute;e national des civilisations &eacute;gyptiennes (NMEC)</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Le déjeuner sera servi dans un restaurant local. Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage.,Guide touristique privé,Visite shopping au Caire</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire., Conseils</p></body></html>'),
(309, 79, 'en', 'The Egyptian Museum, Citadel and Old Cairo', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55257.608248902114!2d31.161569621679682!3d30.048316700000008!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1458b14d72adf029%3A0x9a38f9bbb6edbfe4!2sThe%20Egyptian%20Museum%20in%20Cairo!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689078480!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>Discover the magic of Cairo on the Wonderful Egyptian Museum, Citadel, and Old Cairo Private Tour. Our tour will bring the city\'s incredible history to life, taking you to some of its most iconic sites. With Pharaoh Vibes Tours, you\'ll enjoy a comfortable trip in a private A/C vehicle, guided by a professional Egyptologist. Start your adventure at the&nbsp;Egyptian Museum, which features&nbsp;artifacts&nbsp;from the Pharaonic period, then head to the&nbsp;Citadel of Saladin&nbsp;to see the stunning&nbsp;Mohamed Ali Alabaster Mosque. Explore&nbsp;Old Cairo, where you\'ll visit the&nbsp;Hanging Church,&nbsp;Ben Ezra Synagogue,&nbsp;Church of St. Barbara, and&nbsp;Church of Abu Serga. After a day packed with sights and stories, we\'ll return you to your hotel. Book this amazing tour and see the best of Cairo!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Egyptian Museum</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Hanging Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Ben Ezra Synagogue</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Abu Serga Church</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Lunch meal will be served in a local restaurant.,Bottled water during your trip.,Shopping tour in cairo.,All taxes & service charge.,Private tour guide', 'Tips,Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.'),
(310, 79, 'es', 'El Museo egipcio, Ciudadela y El Cairo antiguo', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>Descubre la magia de El Cairo en el maravilloso Museo Egipcio, Ciudadela y el antiguo Tour Privado de El Cairo. Nuestro recorrido traer&aacute; la incre&iacute;ble historia de la ciudad a la vida, llev&aacute;ndote a algunos de sus sitios m&aacute;s ic&oacute;nicos. Con Faraon Vibes Tours, disfrutar&aacute;s de un c&oacute;modo viaje en un veh&iacute;culo A/C privado, guiado por un profesional egipcio. Comience su aventura en el Museo egipcio, que cuenta con artefactos del per&iacute;odo fara&oacute;nico, luego dir&iacute;jase a la Ciudadela de Saladin para ver la impresionante mezquita Mohamed Ali Alabaster. Explora el Antiguo El Cairo, donde visitar&aacute;s la Iglesia Colgante, la Sinagoga de Ben Ezra, Iglesia de St. Barbara, y la Iglesia de Abu Serga. Despu&eacute;s de un d&iacute;a lleno de vistas e historias, te devolveremos a tu hotel. Reserve este incre&iacute;ble tour y vea lo mejor de El Cairo!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">El Museo egipcio</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Hanging Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Ben Ezra Synagogue</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Abu Serga Church</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., La comida se sirve en un restaurante local., Agua embotellada durante su viaje., Tour de compras en Cairo., Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio., Guía turística privada</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Consejos,Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.</p></body></html>'),
(311, 79, 'fr', 'Musée égyptien, Citadelle et Vieux Caire', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>D&eacute;couvrez la magie du Caire sur le merveilleux mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien, la citadelle et la visite priv&eacute;e du Vieux Caire. Notre visite vous fera d&eacute;couvrir l\'incroyable histoire de la ville, en vous rendant sur certains de ses sites les plus embl&eacute;matiques. Avec Pharaon Vibes Tours, vous appr&eacute;cierez un voyage confortable dans un v&eacute;hicule priv&eacute; A / C, guid&eacute; par un &eacute;gyptologue professionnel. Commencez votre aventure au Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien, qui pr&eacute;sente des artefacts de l\'&eacute;poque pharaonique, puis dirigez-vous vers la Citadelle de Saladin pour voir la superbe mosqu&eacute;e Mohamed Ali Alabaster. Explorez le vieux Caire, o&ugrave; vous visiterez l\'&eacute;glise suspendue, la synagogue Ben Ezra, l\'&eacute;glise Sainte Barbara et l\'&eacute;glise Abu Serga. Apr&egrave;s une journ&eacute;e remplie de sites et d\'histoires, nous vous rendrons &agrave; votre h&ocirc;tel. R&eacute;servez cette visite incroyable et voyez le meilleur du Caire!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div>\r\n<section>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Le Mus&eacute;e &eacute;gyptien</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Hanging Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Ben Ezra Synagogue</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Abu Serga Church</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Le déjeuner sera servi dans un restaurant local. Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage., Visite shopping au Caire., Toutes taxes et frais de service, Guide touristique privé</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Conseils,Tout extra non mentionné dans l\'itinéraire.</p></body></html>'),
(312, 80, 'en', 'Islamic Cairo Full Day Tour', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13817.131087352813!2d31.24126037272995!3d30.028744412398034!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x145840ac90c2ed63%3A0x2fdb96e4e9f72e6f!2sSaladin%20Citadel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689022806!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Discover Islamic Cairo with Sun Pyramids Tours. Visit the historic Citadel, marvel at Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, and explore Sultan Hassan\'s Mosque. Experience the grandeur of Al-Refai Mosque. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Discover Islamic Cairo with Pharaoh Vibes Tours. Visit the historic Citadel, marvel at Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, and explore Sultan Hassan\'s Mosque. Experience the grandeur of Al-Refai Mosque.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Islamic Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque-Madrassa of Sultan Hassan</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Walking tour of Cairo’s most important Islamic sites.,Lunch at Local restaurant.,Entrance fees to the above-mentioned sites.,Pick up from your hotel in Cairo.,Private tour guide,Shopping tour in cairo.,All taxes & service charge.', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary,Tipping'),
(313, 80, 'es', 'Recorrido del Día Completo Islámico de El Cairo', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Discover Islamic Cairo with Sun Pyramids Tours. Visit the historic Citadel, marvel at Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, and explore Sultan Hassan\'s Mosque. Experience the grandeur of Al-Refai Mosque. &quot;}\">Descubra el Cairo isl&aacute;mico con el Fara&oacute;n Vibes Tours. Visite la hist&oacute;rica Ciudadela, maravillese en la mezquita de Mohamed Ali, y explore la mezquita de Sult&aacute;n Hassan. Experimenta la grandeza de la mezquita Al-Refai.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Islamic Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque-Madrassa of Sultan Hassan</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Paseo a pie por los lugares islámicos más importantes de El Cairo., almuerzo en el restaurante local., Derechos de entrada a los sitios mencionados anteriormente, Recógete de tu hotel en El Cairo.,Guía de viaje privada,Visita turística en Cairo., Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario,Tipping</p></body></html>'),
(314, 80, 'fr', 'Visite d\'une journée au Caire islamique', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Discover Islamic Cairo with Sun Pyramids Tours. Visit the historic Citadel, marvel at Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, and explore Sultan Hassan\'s Mosque. Experience the grandeur of Al-Refai Mosque. &quot;}\">Discover Islamic Cairo with Pharaoh Vibes Tours. Visit the historic Citadel, marvel at Mohamed Ali\'s Mosque, and explore Sultan Hassan\'s Mosque. Experience the grandeur of Al-Refai Mosque.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Islamic Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saladin Citadel of Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque of Muhammad Ali</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mosque-Madrassa of Sultan Hassan</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Walking tour of Cairo’s most important Islamic sites.,Lunch at Local restaurant.,Entrance fees to the above-mentioned sites.,Pick up from your hotel in Cairo.,Private tour guide,Shopping tour in cairo.,All taxes &amp; service charge.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary,Tipping</p></body></html>'),
(315, 81, 'en', 'Coptic Cairo and Cave Church', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3454.230869390397!2d31.27425907468198!3d30.030233774930693!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x145841d482db7d87%3A0x7fc83c2d62c97d76!2sThe%20Cave%20Church!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776688908579!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p>Visit Christian sites in Cairo and Churches in Cairo, the Church of Abu-Sergah and St. Barbara, the&nbsp;<strong>hanging church</strong>, and the old Jewish synagogue&nbsp;<strong>Ben Ezra Synagogue,&nbsp;</strong>then visit The Famous Cave Church .</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Coptic Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Abu Serga Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Hanging Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Cave Church of Saint Simon</li>\r\n</ul>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Bottled water during your trip.,Shopping tours in Cairo.,All taxes & service charge.,Private Tour Guide', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.,Tipping.'),
(316, 81, 'es', 'Coptic Cairo and Cave Church', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p>Visita sitios cristianos en El Cairo y Iglesias en El Cairo, la Iglesia de Abu-Sergah y Santa B&aacute;rbara, la<strong>hanging church</strong>, and the old Jewish synagogue&nbsp;<strong>Ben Ezra Synagogue,&nbsp;</strong>then visit The Famous Cave Church .</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Coptic Cairo</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Abu Serga Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Hanging Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Cave Church of Saint Simon</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., Agua embotellada durante su viaje., Viajes de compras en El Cairo.,Todos los impuestos y cargo de servicio., Guía del Tour Privado</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.</p></body></html>'),
(317, 81, 'fr', 'Église copte du Caire et de la grotte', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p>Visitez les sites chr&eacute;tiens au Caire et les &eacute;glises au Caire, l\'&eacute;glise d\'Abu-Sergah et Sainte Barbara,<strong>hanging church</strong>, and the old Jewish synagogue&nbsp;<strong>Ben Ezra Synagogue,&nbsp;</strong>then visit The Famous Cave Church .</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Le Caire copte</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Abu Serga Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Hanging Church</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">The Cave Church of Saint Simon</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage., Circuits commerciaux au Caire.,Toutes taxes et frais de service., Guide touristique privé</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire.,Tipping.</p></body></html>'),
(318, 82, 'en', 'Cairo by Night Tour', 'Approx. 8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3453.6630933697943!2d31.221723974682703!3d30.046521974922516!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1458409aa81d58a5%3A0x6ce6bf7cd258d6fe!2sCairo%20Tower!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776688955177!5m2!1sen!2seg', '6 pm', '<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"683\">Discover the magic of Cairo after sunset with Pharaoh Vibes Tours. This enchanting evening journey takes you through Cairo&rsquo;s most iconic night-time attractions &ndash; from panoramic city views atop the Cairo Tower, to the bustling souks of Khan El Khalili. Drift serenely on the Nile aboard a traditional felucca or take a charming horse carriage ride through the city streets. Experience Cairo&rsquo;s vibrant energy, rich history, and timeless charm as it truly comes alive at night.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"704\">&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, 'Hotel pick-up and drop-off,Professional English-speaking guide,Entrance fees to Cairo Tower,Choice of felucca or horse carriage ride,Bottled water during the tour', 'Personal expenses and shopping,Gratuities (optional)'),
(319, 82, 'es', 'El Cairo by Night Tour', 'Aprox. 8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '6 pm', '<p data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"207\">Descubre la magia de El Cairo despu&eacute;s del atardecer con Faraon Vibes Tours. Este encantador viaje nocturno le lleva a trav&eacute;s de las atracciones nocturnas m&aacute;s emblem&aacute;ticas de El Cairo, desde las vistas panor&aacute;micas de la ciudad sobre la Torre de El Cairo, hasta los bulliciosos zocos de Khan El Khalilili. Drift serenamente en el Nilo a bordo de una felucca tradicional o tomar un encantador paseo en coche de caballo por las calles de la ciudad. Experimente la energ&iacute;a vibrante de El Cairo, la historia rica y el encanto atemporal ya que realmente cobra vida por la noche.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"685\">&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Hotel pick-up and drop-off,Guía profesional de habla inglesa,Precios de entrada a la torre de El Cairo,Choice de felucca o paseo en coche de caballo, Agua embotellada durante el tour</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Gastos personales y compras,Gratuidades (opcional)</p></body></html>'),
(320, 82, 'fr', 'Visite du Caire par nuit', 'Environ 8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '18 heures', '<p data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"207\">D&eacute;couvrez la magie du Caire apr&egrave;s le coucher du soleil avec Pharaon Vibes Tours. Ce voyage enchanteur en soir&eacute;e vous emm&egrave;ne &agrave; travers les attractions les plus embl&eacute;matiques de la nuit du Caire &ndash; de la vue panoramique sur la ville au sommet de la tour du Caire, aux souks anim&eacute;s de Khan El Khalili. Drift sereinement sur le Nil &agrave; bord d\'un f&eacute;lucca traditionnel ou prendre une charmante voiture &agrave; cheval &agrave; travers les rues de la ville. Exp&eacute;rimentez l\'&eacute;nergie vibrante du Caire, la riche histoire et le charme intemporel comme il vient vraiment vivant la nuit.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"685\">&nbsp;</h3>', NULL, '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose d\'hôtels,Guide professionnel anglophone,Tarifs d\'entrée à la Tour du Caire,Choisie de félcca ou promenade en calèche,Eau bouchée pendant la visite</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Frais personnels et achats,Gratuit (facultatif)</p></body></html>'),
(321, 83, 'en', '4 nights cruise from Luxor', '5 days 4 nights', 'Private Tour', 'Always', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"397\">Sail along the legendary Nile River and immerse yourself in the timeless wonders of ancient Egypt on this 5-day / 4-night Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan. This journey combines the comfort of a modern cruise ship with guided tours of Egypt&rsquo;s most famous temples, tombs, and monuments.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"746\">From the colossal statues of Ramses II to the delicate reliefs of Philae and the hidden tombs of the Valley of the Kings, you&rsquo;ll witness more than 3,000 years of history unfold before your eyes. Optional experiences, such as a breathtaking hot air balloon flight over Luxor or an excursion to Abu Simbel, make this itinerary truly unforgettable.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"941\"><strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"812\">Luxor&rsquo;s East Bank Treasures</strong>: Explore the majestic Karnak Temple Complex and the Temple of Luxor with its towering columns and statues of Ramses the Great.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"970\">The West Bank of Luxor</strong>: Discover the Valley of the Kings, the Colossi of Memnon, and the stunning Temple of Medinet Habu built by Ramses III.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1223\"><strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1127\">Optional Hot Air Balloon Ride</strong>: Glide over Luxor&rsquo;s temples, valleys, and monuments at sunrise for a once-in-a-lifetime view.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1379\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1253\">Edfu &amp; Kom Ombo Temples</strong>: Visit the best-preserved temple of Horus at Edfu and the unique double temple dedicated to Sobek and Haroeris at Kom Ombo.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1520\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1407\">Aswan &amp; Philae Temple</strong>: Experience the serene beauty of Aswan and tour the enchanting Temple of Philae dedicated to the goddess Isis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1670\"><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1556\">Optional Abu Simbel Excursion</strong>: Marvel at the monumental rock-cut temples of Ramses II and Queen Nefertari, saved from the rising Nile waters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1803\"><strong data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1693\">Comfort on Board</strong>: Enjoy full-board meals, afternoon tea, and the relaxing ambiance of a Nile cruise ship between excursions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Meet & assist upon arrival and departure in Luxor and Aswan,All transfers by private air-conditioned vehicle,4 nights’ accommodation on a 5★ Nile Cruise on full-board basis (breakfast, lunch, dinner),All sightseeing tours mentioned in the itinerary with entrance fees,Licensed English-speaking Egyptologist guide during all excursions,Service charges and taxes', 'Egypt entry visa,International or domestic flights to/from Luxor or Aswan,Personal expenses (laundry, phone calls, etc.),Drinks on board (unless stated otherwise),Optional tours (Hot Air Balloon over Luxor, Abu Simbel excursion,Tips & gratuities'),
(322, 83, 'es', '4 noches de crucero desde Luxor', '5 días 4 noches', 'Tour privado', 'Siempre', '8 am', '<p data-end=\"397\" data-start=\"111\">Navega por el legendario r&iacute;o Nilo y sumergirse en las maravillas atemporales del antiguo Egipto en este crucero de Nilo de 5 d&iacute;as / 4 noches de Luxor a Aswan. Este viaje combina la comodidad de un crucero moderno con visitas guiadas a los templos, tumbas y monumentos m&aacute;s famosos de Egipto.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"399\">From the colossal statues of Ramses II to the delicate reliefs of Philae and the hidden tombs of the Valley of the Kings, you&rsquo;ll witness more than 3,000 years of history unfold before your eyes. Optional experiences, such as a breathtaking hot air balloon flight over Luxor or an excursion to Abu Simbel, make this itinerary truly unforgettable.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"779\">\r\n<p data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"781\"><strong data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"781\">Banco Oriental de Luxor Tesoros</strong>: Explore the majestic Karnak Temple Complex and the Temple of Luxor with its towering columns and statues of Ramses the Great.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"942\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"944\"><strong data-end=\"970\" data-start=\"944\">The West Bank of Luxor</strong>: Discover the Valley of the Kings, the Colossi of Memnon, and the stunning Temple of Medinet Habu built by Ramses III.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1092\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1094\"><strong data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1094\">Optional Hot Air Balloon Ride</strong>: Glide over Luxor&rsquo;s temples, valleys, and monuments at sunrise for a once-in-a-lifetime view.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1379\" data-start=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1379\" data-start=\"1226\"><strong data-end=\"1253\" data-start=\"1226\">Edfu &amp; Kom Ombo Temples</strong>: Visit the best-preserved temple of Horus at Edfu and the unique double temple dedicated to Sobek and Haroeris at Kom Ombo.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1520\" data-start=\"1380\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1520\" data-start=\"1382\"><strong data-end=\"1407\" data-start=\"1382\">Aswan &amp; Philae Temple</strong>: Experience the serene beauty of Aswan and tour the enchanting Temple of Philae dedicated to the goddess Isis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1521\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1523\"><strong data-end=\"1556\" data-start=\"1523\">Optional Abu Simbel Excursion</strong>: Marvel at the monumental rock-cut temples of Ramses II and Queen Nefertari, saved from the rising Nile waters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1803\" data-start=\"1671\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1803\" data-start=\"1673\"><strong data-end=\"1693\" data-start=\"1673\">Comfort on Board</strong>: Enjoy full-board meals, afternoon tea, and the relaxing ambiance of a Nile cruise ship between excursions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Meet &amp;amp; assist upon arrival and departure in Luxor and Aswan,All transfers by private air-with vehicle,4 nights’ accommodation on a 5★ Nile Cruise on full-board basis (breakfast, lunch, dinner),Todos los tours turísticos mencionados en el itinerario con entradas,Licensed English-speaking Egyptologist guide during all tours,Service charges and taxes</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Visa de entrada de Egipto, Vuelos internacionales o domésticos a/desde Luxor o Aswan, Gastos personales (lavadero, llamadas telefónicas, etc.),Bebidas a bordo (a menos que se indique lo contrario),Optional tours (Hot Air Balloon sobre Luxor, Abu Simbel excursión,Tips &amp; gratuities</p></body></html>');
INSERT INTO `tour_translations` (`id`, `tour_id`, `locale`, `title`, `duration`, `type`, `run`, `pickup_time`, `overview`, `highlights`, `included`, `excluded`) VALUES
(323, 83, 'fr', '4 nuits de croisière au départ de Luxor', '5 jours 4 nuits', 'Visite privée', 'Toujours', '8 heures', '<p data-end=\"397\" data-start=\"111\">Naviguez le long de la l&eacute;gendaire rivi&egrave;re Nil et plongez-vous dans les merveilles intemporelles de l\'&Eacute;gypte antique lors de cette croisi&egrave;re Nil de 5 jours / 4 nuits de Louxor &agrave; Assouan. Ce voyage combine le confort d\'un bateau de croisi&egrave;re moderne avec des visites guid&eacute;es de l\'Egypte les plus c&eacute;l&egrave;bres temples, tombes et monuments.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"399\">From the colossal statues of Ramses II to the delicate reliefs of Philae and the hidden tombs of the Valley of the Kings, you&rsquo;ll witness more than 3,000 years of history unfold before your eyes. Optional experiences, such as a breathtaking hot air balloon flight over Luxor or an excursion to Abu Simbel, make this itinerary truly unforgettable.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"779\">\r\n<p data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"781\"><strong data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"781\">Banque Est de Luxor Tr&eacute;sors</strong>: Explore the majestic Karnak Temple Complex and the Temple of Luxor with its towering columns and statues of Ramses the Great.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"942\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"944\"><strong data-end=\"970\" data-start=\"944\">The West Bank of Luxor</strong>: Discover the Valley of the Kings, the Colossi of Memnon, and the stunning Temple of Medinet Habu built by Ramses III.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1092\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1094\"><strong data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1094\">Optional Hot Air Balloon Ride</strong>: Glide over Luxor&rsquo;s temples, valleys, and monuments at sunrise for a once-in-a-lifetime view.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1379\" data-start=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1379\" data-start=\"1226\"><strong data-end=\"1253\" data-start=\"1226\">Edfu &amp; Kom Ombo Temples</strong>: Visit the best-preserved temple of Horus at Edfu and the unique double temple dedicated to Sobek and Haroeris at Kom Ombo.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1520\" data-start=\"1380\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1520\" data-start=\"1382\"><strong data-end=\"1407\" data-start=\"1382\">Aswan &amp; Philae Temple</strong>: Experience the serene beauty of Aswan and tour the enchanting Temple of Philae dedicated to the goddess Isis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1521\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1523\"><strong data-end=\"1556\" data-start=\"1523\">Optional Abu Simbel Excursion</strong>: Marvel at the monumental rock-cut temples of Ramses II and Queen Nefertari, saved from the rising Nile waters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1803\" data-start=\"1671\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1803\" data-start=\"1673\"><strong data-end=\"1693\" data-start=\"1673\">Comfort on Board</strong>: Enjoy full-board meals, afternoon tea, and the relaxing ambiance of a Nile cruise ship between excursions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Rencontrez et aidez à l\'arrivée et au départ à Louxor et Assouan,Tous les transferts en véhicule climatisé privé,4 nuits de logement sur une croisière du Nil 5★ en pension complète (petit déjeuner, déjeuner, dîner),Tous les tours touristiques mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire avec les frais d\'entrée,Guide gyptologue anglophone autorisé pendant toutes les excursions,Frais de service et taxes</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Visa d\'entrée en Egypte,Vols internationaux ou intérieurs à destination/en provenance de Luxor ou d\'Assouan,Frais personnels (blanchisserie, appels téléphoniques, etc.),Brinks à bord (sauf indication contraire),Visites optionnelles (Hot Air Balloon sur Luxor, Abu Simbel excursion,Conseils &amp; gratuites</p></body></html>'),
(324, 84, 'en', '3 nights cruise from Aswan', '4 days 3 nights', 'Private Tour', 'Always', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"650\">Sail from Aswan to Luxor on a classic <strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"340\">4-day / 3-night Nile Cruise</strong>, combining comfort and guided sightseeing at Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic temples. From the enchanting Philae Temple and the dramatic riverside ruins of Kom Ombo to the immense Karnak complex and the royal tombs of the Valley of the Kings, this cruise offers an unforgettable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s ancient heartland.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"860\">Optional excursions such as Abu Simbel can be added to make your trip even more special. Full board, guided tours, and transfers are included so you can simply relax and enjoy the timeless beauty of the Nile.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"913\">Temple of Philae</strong> in Aswan, dedicated to the goddess Isis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1026\">Optional excursion to <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"994\">Abu Simbel</strong>, Ramses II&rsquo;s colossal temples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1100\"><strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1048\">Kom Ombo Temple</strong> at sunset, uniquely dedicated to Sobek &amp; Haroeris</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1130\">Temple of Horus at Edfu</strong>, one of the best-preserved in Egypt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1223\">Cruise through the <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1203\">Esna Lock</strong> and sail to Luxor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1300\">Explore <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1260\">Luxor &amp; Karnak Temples</strong>, linked by the Avenue of the Sphinxes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1423\">Discover <strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1339\">The Valley of the Kings</strong>, the <strong data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1369\">Temple of Hatshepsut</strong>, and the <strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1400\">Colossi of Memnon</strong> on Luxor&rsquo;s West Bank</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1487\">Comfortable Nile cruise ship with full-board meals included</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Meet & assist upon arrival in Aswan and departure in Luxor,Transfers between airports/stations/hotels and cruise ship,3 nights’ accommodation on a Nile Cruise on full-board basis (breakfast, lunch, dinner),All sightseeing tours mentioned in the itinerary with entrance fees,Licensed English-speaking Egyptologist guide during all excursions,Service charges and taxes', 'Egypt entry visa,International or domestic flights,Optional excursions (Abu Simbel, hot air balloon over Luxor, etc.),Drinks on board (unless otherwise stated),Tips & gratuities,Personal expenses (laundry, phone calls'),
(325, 84, 'es', '3 noches de crucero desde Aswan', '4 días 3 noches', 'Tour privado', 'Siempre', '8 am', '<p data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"271\">Nave de Aswan a Luxor en un cl&aacute;sico<strong data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"309\">4-day / 3-night Nile Cruise</strong>, combining comfort and guided sightseeing at Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic temples. From the enchanting Philae Temple and the dramatic riverside ruins of Kom Ombo to the immense Karnak complex and the royal tombs of the Valley of the Kings, this cruise offers an unforgettable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s ancient heartland.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"652\">Optional excursions such as Abu Simbel can be added to make your trip even more special. Full board, guided tours, and transfers are included so you can simply relax and enjoy the timeless beauty of the Nile.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"891\">\r\n<p data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"893\"><strong data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"893\">Templo de Philae</strong> in Aswan, dedicated to the goddess Isis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"956\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"958\">Optional excursion to <strong data-end=\"994\" data-start=\"980\">Abu Simbel</strong>, Ramses II&rsquo;s colossal temples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1027\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1029\"><strong data-end=\"1048\" data-start=\"1029\">Kom Ombo Temple</strong> at sunset, uniquely dedicated to Sobek &amp; Haroeris</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1101\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1103\"><strong data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1103\">Temple of Horus at Edfu</strong>, one of the best-preserved in Egypt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1169\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1171\">Cruise through the <strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1190\">Esna Lock</strong> and sail to Luxor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1300\" data-start=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1300\" data-start=\"1226\">Explore <strong data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1234\">Luxor &amp; Karnak Temples</strong>, linked by the Avenue of the Sphinxes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1423\" data-start=\"1301\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1423\" data-start=\"1303\">Discover <strong data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"1312\">The Valley of the Kings</strong>, the <strong data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1345\">Temple of Hatshepsut</strong>, and the <strong data-end=\"1400\" data-start=\"1379\">Colossi of Memnon</strong> on Luxor&rsquo;s West Bank</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1487\" data-start=\"1424\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1487\" data-start=\"1426\">Comfortable Nile cruise ship with full-board meals included</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Meet &amp;amp; assist upon arrival in Aswan and departure in Luxor,Transfers between airports/stations/hotels and cruise ship,3 nights’ accommodation on a Nile Cruise on full-board basis (desayuno, almuerzo, cena),Todos los tours turísticos mencionados en el itinerario con entradas,Licensed English-speaking Egyptologist guide durante todas las excursiones,Gastos de servicio e impuestos</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Visa de entrada Egipto, Vuelos internacionales o domésticos,Excursiones opcionales (Abu Simbel, globo de aire caliente sobre Luxor, etc.),Bebidas a bordo (a menos que se indique lo contrario),Tipos &amp;amp; gratuidades, Gastos personales (lavadero, llamadas telefónicas</p></body></html>'),
(326, 84, 'fr', 'Croisière de 3 nuits depuis Aswan', '4 jours 3 nuits', 'Visite privée', 'Toujours', '8 heures', '<p data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"271\">Voile d\'Aswan &agrave; Luxor sur un classique<strong data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"309\">4-day / 3-night Nile Cruise</strong>, combining comfort and guided sightseeing at Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic temples. From the enchanting Philae Temple and the dramatic riverside ruins of Kom Ombo to the immense Karnak complex and the royal tombs of the Valley of the Kings, this cruise offers an unforgettable journey through Egypt&rsquo;s ancient heartland.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"652\">Optional excursions such as Abu Simbel can be added to make your trip even more special. Full board, guided tours, and transfers are included so you can simply relax and enjoy the timeless beauty of the Nile.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"891\">\r\n<p data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"893\"><strong data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"893\">Temple de Philae</strong> in Aswan, dedicated to the goddess Isis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"956\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"958\">Optional excursion to <strong data-end=\"994\" data-start=\"980\">Abu Simbel</strong>, Ramses II&rsquo;s colossal temples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1027\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1029\"><strong data-end=\"1048\" data-start=\"1029\">Kom Ombo Temple</strong> at sunset, uniquely dedicated to Sobek &amp; Haroeris</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1101\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1103\"><strong data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1103\">Temple of Horus at Edfu</strong>, one of the best-preserved in Egypt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1169\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1171\">Cruise through the <strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1190\">Esna Lock</strong> and sail to Luxor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1300\" data-start=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1300\" data-start=\"1226\">Explore <strong data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1234\">Luxor &amp; Karnak Temples</strong>, linked by the Avenue of the Sphinxes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1423\" data-start=\"1301\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1423\" data-start=\"1303\">Discover <strong data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"1312\">The Valley of the Kings</strong>, the <strong data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1345\">Temple of Hatshepsut</strong>, and the <strong data-end=\"1400\" data-start=\"1379\">Colossi of Memnon</strong> on Luxor&rsquo;s West Bank</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1487\" data-start=\"1424\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1487\" data-start=\"1426\">Comfortable Nile cruise ship with full-board meals included</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Rencontrer &amp; assister à l\'arrivée à Assouan et départ à Luxor,Transferts entre aéroports/stations/hôtels et bateau de croisière,3 nuits , Hébergement sur une croisière Nil sur la base de la pension complète (petit déjeuner, déjeuner, dîner),Toutes les visites mentionnées dans l\'itinéraire avec les frais d\'entrée,Licensed guide geptologue anglophone pendant toutes les excursions,Frais de service et taxes</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Visa d\'entrée en Egypte,Vols internationaux ou intérieurs,Excursions facultatives (Abu Simbel, ballon d\'air chaud au-dessus de Luxor, etc.),Boissons à bord (sauf indication contraire),Conseils &amp; gratifications,Frais personnels (blanchisserie, appels téléphoniques)</p></body></html>'),
(327, 85, 'en', 'Dendera & Abydos', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', '8 am', '<p>Abydos temple and Hathor temple at Dendara, the best preserved in Egypt with full color still visible on its walls.</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"ES\"><a href=\"http://www.toursfromhurghada.com/marsa-alam-excursions/dendera-and-abydos-day-tour-from-marsa-alam/\"> </a></span>The beautiful Dendera Temple is the home of the Goddess of joy, healing &amp; love, \"Hathor\". All the while, Abydos Temple is one of the most religious archaeological sites in the history of ancient Egypt. The Temple of Abydos is known also as the temple of the underworld&rsquo;s ruler, <span lang=\"ES\"><a href=\"http://www.toursfromhurghada.com/marsa-alam-excursions/dendera-and-abydos-day-tour-from-marsa-alam/\"> </a></span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<p data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"936\"><strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"722\">Dendera Temple</strong>: Marvel at one of the best-preserved temple complexes in Egypt, dedicated to Hathor, goddess of love, joy, and healing. See its magnificent fa&ccedil;ade, hieroglyph-covered ceilings, sanatorium, and detailed carvings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1186\"><strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"956\">Abydos Temple</strong>: Visit the sacred burial place of Osiris and the memorial temple of Seti I. Admire the Abydos King List&mdash;one of the most important chronological records of ancient Egypt&mdash;and the beautifully preserved chapels of multiple deities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick-up and drop-off at your hotel in Luxor (or agreed location),Private air-conditioned vehicle for all transfers,Entrance fees to Dendera and Abydos temples,Professional English-speaking Egyptologist guide,Lunch during the tour,Bottled water on board the vehicle,All taxes & service charges', 'Drinks at lunch,Tips & gratuities,Personal expenses,Optional extras not mentioned'),
(328, 85, 'es', 'Dendera &amp; Abydos', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p>Templo de Abydos y templo de Hathor en Dendara, el mejor conservado en Egipto con todo color a&uacute;n visible en sus paredes.</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"ES\"><a href=\"http://www.toursfromhurghada.com/marsa-alam-excursions/dendera-and-abydos-day-tour-from-marsa-alam/\"> </a></span>The beautiful Dendera Temple is the home of the Goddess of joy, healing &amp; love, \"Hathor\". All the while, Abydos Temple is one of the most religious archaeological sites in the history of ancient Egypt. The Temple of Abydos is known also as the temple of the underworld&rsquo;s ruler, <span lang=\"ES\"><a href=\"http://www.toursfromhurghada.com/marsa-alam-excursions/dendera-and-abydos-day-tour-from-marsa-alam/\"> </a></span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"702\">\r\n<p data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"704\"><strong data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"704\">Templo de Dendera</strong>: Marvel at one of the best-preserved temple complexes in Egypt, dedicated to Hathor, goddess of love, joy, and healing. See its magnificent fa&ccedil;ade, hieroglyph-covered ceilings, sanatorium, and detailed carvings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"937\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"939\"><strong data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"939\">Abydos Temple</strong>: Visit the sacred burial place of Osiris and the memorial temple of Seti I. Admire the Abydos King List&mdash;one of the most important chronological records of ancient Egypt&mdash;and the beautifully preserved chapels of multiple deities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Recogida y entrega en su hotel en Luxor (o ubicación acordada),Vehículo privado con aire acondicionado para todos los traslados,Ingresos a los templos de Dendera y Abydos,Profesional guía egipologista de habla inglesa,Almuerzo durante el tour, Agua embotellada a bordo del vehículo,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Bebidas en el almuerzo,Tips &amp; gratuidades, Gastos personales, extras opcionales no mencionados</p></body></html>'),
(329, 85, 'fr', 'Dendera & Abydos', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p>Le temple Abydos et le temple Hathor &agrave; Dendrara, le mieux conserv&eacute; en Egypte avec toute la couleur encore visible sur ses murs.</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"ES\"><a href=\"http://www.toursfromhurghada.com/marsa-alam-excursions/dendera-and-abydos-day-tour-from-marsa-alam/\"> </a></span>The beautiful Dendera Temple is the home of the Goddess of joy, healing &amp; love, \"Hathor\". All the while, Abydos Temple is one of the most religious archaeological sites in the history of ancient Egypt. The Temple of Abydos is known also as the temple of the underworld&rsquo;s ruler, <span lang=\"ES\"><a href=\"http://www.toursfromhurghada.com/marsa-alam-excursions/dendera-and-abydos-day-tour-from-marsa-alam/\"> </a></span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"702\">\r\n<p data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"704\"><strong data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"704\">Temple Dendera</strong>: Marvel at one of the best-preserved temple complexes in Egypt, dedicated to Hathor, goddess of love, joy, and healing. See its magnificent fa&ccedil;ade, hieroglyph-covered ceilings, sanatorium, and detailed carvings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"937\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"939\"><strong data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"939\">Abydos Temple</strong>: Visit the sacred burial place of Osiris and the memorial temple of Seti I. Admire the Abydos King List&mdash;one of the most important chronological records of ancient Egypt&mdash;and the beautifully preserved chapels of multiple deities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose à votre hôtel à Luxor (ou emplacement convenu),Véhicule climatisé privé pour tous les transferts,Frais d\'entrée aux temples Dendera et Abydos,Guide égyptien anglophone professionnel,Lunch pendant la visite,Eau bouillante à bord du véhicule,Toutes taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Boissons au déjeuner,Astuces &amp; gratifications,Frais personnels,Optionnels extras non mentionnés</p></body></html>'),
(330, 86, 'en', 'West Bank Visits', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d28761.189169643872!2d32.67509978916016!3d25.699501999999995!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x144915c41edadf61%3A0x7693895c346c7d81!2z2YXYudio2K8g2KfZhNin2YLYtdix!5e0!3m2!1sar!2seg!4v1776632588813!5m2!1sar!2seg\\', '8 am', '<p>Luxor was the ancient city of Thebes, the glorious city of Amun, and the capital of Upper Egypt. It is also the world&rsquo;s greatest open-air museum with its ancient ruins and monuments all over the city. We offer you a chance to uncover the secrets of this ancient land with a full-day tour of Luxor&rsquo;s west bank.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1097\"><strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"993\">Valley of the Kings</strong>: Enter three of the most celebrated royal tombs, with their colourful wall paintings and hieroglyphs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1124\">Temple of Hatshepsut</strong>: Discover the three-terraced mortuary temple of Egypt&rsquo;s most powerful female pharaoh.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1303\"><strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1236\">Colossi of Memnon</strong>: Photograph the gigantic seated statues guarding the necropolis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1427\"><strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1332\">Temple of Medinet Habu</strong>: Explore one of the best-preserved temples on the West Bank, known for its detailed reliefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1533\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1533\"><strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1472\">Complimentary Alabaster Workshop Visit</strong>: See local artisans at work and shop for unique souvenirs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Hotel pick-up and drop-off in Luxor,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Private air-conditioned vehicle,Entrance fees to sites listed (standard tickets),Bottled water during the tour,Complimentary visit to an alabaster workshop,All taxes & service charges', 'Any optional tombs requiring separate tickets (e.g. Tutankhamun- Seti I),Meals and drinks unless specified,Tips & gratuities,Personal expenses'),
(331, 86, 'es', 'West Bank Visits', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p>Luxor era la antigua ciudad de Tebas, la gloriosa ciudad de Am&oacute;n, y la capital del Alto Egipto. Tambi&eacute;n es el museo al aire libre m&aacute;s grande del mundo con sus antiguas ruinas y monumentos en toda la ciudad. Le ofrecemos la oportunidad de descubrir los secretos de esta antigua tierra con un recorrido de d&iacute;a completo del banco oeste de Luxor.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"968\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"970\"><strong data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"970\">Valle de los Reyes</strong>: Enter three of the most celebrated royal tombs, with their colourful wall paintings and hieroglyphs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1098\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1100\"><strong data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1100\">Temple of Hatshepsut</strong>: Discover the three-terraced mortuary temple of Egypt&rsquo;s most powerful female pharaoh.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1213\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1215\"><strong data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1215\">Colossi of Memnon</strong>: Photograph the gigantic seated statues guarding the necropolis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1427\" data-start=\"1304\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1427\" data-start=\"1306\"><strong data-end=\"1332\" data-start=\"1306\">Temple of Medinet Habu</strong>: Explore one of the best-preserved temples on the West Bank, known for its detailed reliefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1428\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1430\"><strong data-end=\"1472\" data-start=\"1430\">Complimentary Alabaster Workshop Visit</strong>: See local artisans at work and shop for unique souvenirs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Hotel pick-up and drop-off in Luxor,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Vehículo privado con aire acondicionado,Precios de entrada a los sitios listados (boquetes estándar), Agua embotellada durante el tour,Visita gratuita a un taller de alabastro,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier tumba opcional que requiera entradas separadas (por ejemplo, Tutankhamun- Seti I), Comidas y bebidas a menos que se especifique,Tipos &amp;quot; gratuidades, Gastos personales</p></body></html>'),
(332, 86, 'fr', 'Visites en Cisjordanie', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p>Louxor &eacute;tait la ville antique de Th&egrave;bes, la ville glorieuse d\'Amun, et la capitale de la Haute Egypte. C\'est aussi le plus grand mus&eacute;e en plein air du monde avec ses ruines anciennes et ses monuments dans toute la ville. Nous vous offrons l\'occasion de d&eacute;couvrir les secrets de cette terre antique avec une visite d\'une journ&eacute;e de Luxor.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"968\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"970\"><strong data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"970\">Vall&eacute;e des Rois</strong>: Enter three of the most celebrated royal tombs, with their colourful wall paintings and hieroglyphs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1098\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1100\"><strong data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1100\">Temple of Hatshepsut</strong>: Discover the three-terraced mortuary temple of Egypt&rsquo;s most powerful female pharaoh.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1213\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1215\"><strong data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1215\">Colossi of Memnon</strong>: Photograph the gigantic seated statues guarding the necropolis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1427\" data-start=\"1304\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1427\" data-start=\"1306\"><strong data-end=\"1332\" data-start=\"1306\">Temple of Medinet Habu</strong>: Explore one of the best-preserved temples on the West Bank, known for its detailed reliefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1428\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1533\" data-start=\"1430\"><strong data-end=\"1472\" data-start=\"1430\">Complimentary Alabaster Workshop Visit</strong>: See local artisans at work and shop for unique souvenirs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose d\'hôtels à Luxor,Guide égyptologue agréé,Véhicule climatisé privé,Droits d\'entrée sur les sites listés (billets standard),Eau bouillante pendant la visite,Visite gratuite d\'un atelier d\'albâtre,Toutes taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les tombeaux optionnels nécessitant des billets séparés (par exemple Tutankhamun- Seti I), des repas et des boissons sauf indication contraire, des conseils et des gratifications, des dépenses personnelles</p></body></html>'),
(333, 87, 'en', 'East Bank Visits', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"533\">Begin your day exploring the East Bank of Luxor &mdash; the heart of ancient Thebes &mdash; with a professional Egyptologist guide. Visit the awe-inspiring <strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"299\">Karnak Temple</strong>, the largest religious complex ever built, and walk in the footsteps of pharaohs at the majestic <strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"413\">Luxor Temple</strong>. This half-day tour reveals the grandeur of ancient Egyptian worship and the architectural genius of the New Kingdom.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"784\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"591\">Karnak Temple Complex</strong>: Marvel at towering columns, colossal statues, sacred lakes, and intricately carved hieroglyphs in Egypt&rsquo;s largest temple precinct, dedicated to the Theban triad of Amun-Ra, Mut, and Khonsu.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"949\"><strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"803\">Luxor Temple</strong>: Stroll along one of Egypt&rsquo;s most elegant temples, begun by Amenhotep III and expanded by Tutankhamun, Ramses II, and even Alexander the Great.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick-up and drop-off from your hotel in Luxor,Private air-conditioned vehicle,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Entrance fees to Karnak & Luxor Temples,Bottled water during the tour,All taxes and service charges', 'Meals or drinks unless specified,Tips & gratuities,Personal expenses,Optional extras not mentioned'),
(334, 87, 'es', 'East Bank Visits', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"138\">Comience su d&iacute;a explorando el Banco Oriental de Luxor &mdash;el coraz&oacute;n de los antiguos Tebas&mdash; con un gu&iacute;a egipcio profesional. Visitar el impresionante<strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"282\">Karnak Temple</strong>, the largest religious complex ever built, and walk in the footsteps of pharaohs at the majestic <strong data-end=\"413\" data-start=\"397\">Luxor Temple</strong>. This half-day tour reveals the grandeur of ancient Egyptian worship and the architectural genius of the New Kingdom.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"564\">\r\n<p data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"566\"><strong data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"566\">Complejo del templo de Karnak</strong>: Marvel at towering columns, colossal statues, sacred lakes, and intricately carved hieroglyphs in Egypt&rsquo;s largest temple precinct, dedicated to the Theban triad of Amun-Ra, Mut, and Khonsu.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"785\">\r\n<p data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"787\"><strong data-end=\"803\" data-start=\"787\">Luxor Temple</strong>: Stroll along one of Egypt&rsquo;s most elegant temples, begun by Amenhotep III and expanded by Tutankhamun, Ramses II, and even Alexander the Great.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Recogida y despegue de su hotel en Luxor,Vehículo privado con aire acondicionado,Guía egipcia centrada,Precios de entrada a Karnak &amp;amp; Luxor Temples, Agua embotellada durante el tour,Todos los impuestos y gastos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Comidas o bebidas a menos que se especifique,Tipos &amp;amp; gratuidades, Gastos personales, extras opcionales no mencionados</p></body></html>'),
(335, 87, 'fr', 'Visites de la Banque Est', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"138\">Commencez votre journ&eacute;e &agrave; explorer la rive est de Louxor, le c&oelig;ur des anciennes Th&eacute;bes, avec un guide &eacute;gyptologue professionnel. Visitez l\'&eacute;merveillement<strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"282\">Karnak Temple</strong>, the largest religious complex ever built, and walk in the footsteps of pharaohs at the majestic <strong data-end=\"413\" data-start=\"397\">Luxor Temple</strong>. This half-day tour reveals the grandeur of ancient Egyptian worship and the architectural genius of the New Kingdom.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"564\">\r\n<p data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"566\"><strong data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"566\">Complexe du temple Karnak</strong>: Marvel at towering columns, colossal statues, sacred lakes, and intricately carved hieroglyphs in Egypt&rsquo;s largest temple precinct, dedicated to the Theban triad of Amun-Ra, Mut, and Khonsu.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"785\">\r\n<p data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"787\"><strong data-end=\"803\" data-start=\"787\">Luxor Temple</strong>: Stroll along one of Egypt&rsquo;s most elegant temples, begun by Amenhotep III and expanded by Tutankhamun, Ramses II, and even Alexander the Great.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose de votre hôtel à Luxor,Véhicule climatisé privé,Guide égyptien autorisé,Postes d\'entrée à Karnak &amp; Luxor Temples,Eau bouchée pendant la visite,Toutes taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Repas ou boissons sauf indication contraire,Conseils et gratifications,Dépenses personnelles,Extras optionnels non mentionnés</p></body></html>'),
(336, 88, 'en', 'Edfu & Kom Ombo day tour', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3616.65861407406!2d32.870047474462496!3d24.977727077852908!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1449ed130bac4eab%3A0xf260759eaff3d5e5!2sEdfu%20Temple!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776690478665!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"581\">Step outside Aswan for a full-day journey along the Nile to two of Egypt&rsquo;s most fascinating temples. With your professional guide, explore the unique <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"314\">double temple of Kom Ombo</strong>, dedicated to both the crocodile god Sobek and the falcon-headed Haroeris, and the magnificent <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"437\">Temple of Horus at Edfu</strong>, the best-preserved temple in Egypt. Travel in comfort by air-conditioned vehicle and enjoy a deeper understanding of Egypt&rsquo;s Ptolemaic period.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"708\">Kom Ombo Temple</strong>: Discover the rare double temple layout, walk through its twin courtyards and sanctuaries, and see where crocodile mummies were kept.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"1035\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"865\">Temple of Edfu</strong>: Admire the largest and best-preserved Ptolemaic temple in Egypt, dedicated to Horus. Explore its halls, sanctuary, nilometer, and reliefs depicting myths and battles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick-up and drop-off at your hotel in Aswan,Private air-conditioned vehicle,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Entrance fees to Kom Ombo & Edfu temples,Bottled water during the tour,All taxes & service charges', 'Meals or drinks unless specified,Tips & gratuities,Personal expenses,Optional extras not mentioned'),
(337, 88, 'es', 'Edfu Visita de Ombo Day', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"135\">Salga fuera de Aswan para un viaje de d&iacute;a completo a lo largo del Nilo a dos de los templos m&aacute;s fascinantes de Egipto. Con su gu&iacute;a profesional, explore el &uacute;nico<strong data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"285\">double temple of Kom Ombo</strong>, dedicated to both the crocodile god Sobek and the falcon-headed Haroeris, and the magnificent <strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"410\">Temple of Horus at Edfu</strong>, the best-preserved temple in Egypt. Travel in comfort by air-conditioned vehicle and enjoy a deeper understanding of Egypt&rsquo;s Ptolemaic period.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"687\">\r\n<p data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"689\"><strong data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"689\">Templo Kom Ombo</strong>: Discover the rare double temple layout, walk through its twin courtyards and sanctuaries, and see where crocodile mummies were kept.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"845\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"847\"><strong data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"847\">Temple of Edfu</strong>: Admire the largest and best-preserved Ptolemaic temple in Egypt, dedicated to Horus. Explore its halls, sanctuary, nilometer, and reliefs depicting myths and battles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Recogida y desplegable en su hotel en Aswan,Vehículo privado con aire acondicionado,Guía egipcia centrada,Ingresos a los templos Kom Ombo &amp;amp; Edfu, Agua embotellada durante el tour,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Comidas o bebidas a menos que se especifique,Tipos &amp;amp; gratuidades, Gastos personales, extras opcionales no mencionados</p></body></html>'),
(338, 88, 'fr', 'Edfu & Kom Visite d\'une journée à Ombo', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"135\">Sortez d\'Assouan pour un voyage d\'une journ&eacute;e le long du Nil vers deux des temples les plus fascinants de l\'Egypte. Avec votre guide professionnel, explorez le<strong data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"285\">double temple of Kom Ombo</strong>, dedicated to both the crocodile god Sobek and the falcon-headed Haroeris, and the magnificent <strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"410\">Temple of Horus at Edfu</strong>, the best-preserved temple in Egypt. Travel in comfort by air-conditioned vehicle and enjoy a deeper understanding of Egypt&rsquo;s Ptolemaic period.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"687\">\r\n<p data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"689\"><strong data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"689\">Temple Kom Ombo</strong>: Discover the rare double temple layout, walk through its twin courtyards and sanctuaries, and see where crocodile mummies were kept.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"845\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"847\"><strong data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"847\">Temple of Edfu</strong>: Admire the largest and best-preserved Ptolemaic temple in Egypt, dedicated to Horus. Explore its halls, sanctuary, nilometer, and reliefs depicting myths and battles.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose à votre hôtel à Assouan,Véhicule climatisé privé,Guide égyptologue agréé,Frais d\'entrée aux temples Kom Ombo &amp; Edfu,Eau bouillante pendant la visite,Toutes taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Repas ou boissons sauf indication contraire,Conseils et gratifications,Dépenses personnelles,Extras optionnels non mentionnés</p></body></html>'),
(339, 89, 'en', 'Abu Simbel day tour', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d944670.6061764846!2d30.46857238470479!3d22.349114155893638!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x143aaa0c0b2b0255%3A0xd72413107b5e4b58!2sAbu%20Simbel%2C%20Aswan%20Governorate!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776690329018!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"676\">Witness one of the most awe-inspiring achievements of ancient Egypt on a full-day trip from Aswan to the monumental <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"295\">Temples of Abu Simbel</strong>. Cut into the cliffs by Ramses II more than 3,000 years ago and relocated by UNESCO in the 1960s to save them from the rising waters of Lake Nasser, these temples stand as a testament to Egyptian power and artistry. Travel in comfort by air-conditioned vehicle with an expert Egyptologist guide and discover the stories, symbolism, and history behind these breathtaking monuments.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"987\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"877\">Great Temple of Ramses II</strong>: Admire the colossal 20-metre-high statues guarding the entrance and the richly decorated interior reliefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1022\">Temple of Hathor &amp; Nefertari</strong>: Explore the smaller yet equally stunning temple built in honor of Ramses&rsquo; beloved queen.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1264\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1141\">UNESCO Heritage Site</strong>: Learn how the temples were cut into blocks and moved to higher ground to save them from the Aswan High Dam&rsquo;s reservoir.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick-up and drop-off from your hotel in Aswan,Private air-conditioned vehicle to/from Abu Simbel,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Entrance fees to Abu Simbel temples,Bottled water on board the vehicle,All taxes and service charges', 'Meals or drinks unless specified,Tips & gratuities,Personal expenses,Optional extras not mentioned'),
(340, 89, 'es', 'Tour de Abu Simbel', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"154\">Testigo uno de los logros m&aacute;s impresionantes del antiguo Egipto en un viaje de d&iacute;a completo desde Aswan a la monumental<strong data-end=\"295\" data-start=\"270\">Temples of Abu Simbel</strong>. Cut into the cliffs by Ramses II more than 3,000 years ago and relocated by UNESCO in the 1960s to save them from the rising waters of Lake Nasser, these temples stand as a testament to Egyptian power and artistry. Travel in comfort by air-conditioned vehicle with an expert Egyptologist guide and discover the stories, symbolism, and history behind these breathtaking monuments.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"846\">\r\n<p data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"848\"><strong data-end=\"877\" data-start=\"848\">Gran Templo de Rams&eacute;s II</strong>: Admire the colossal 20-metre-high statues guarding the entrance and the richly decorated interior reliefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"988\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"990\"><strong data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"990\">Temple of Hathor &amp; Nefertari</strong>: Explore the smaller yet equally stunning temple built in honor of Ramses&rsquo; beloved queen.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1115\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1117\"><strong data-end=\"1141\" data-start=\"1117\">UNESCO Heritage Site</strong>: Learn how the temples were cut into blocks and moved to higher ground to save them from the Aswan High Dam&rsquo;s reservoir.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Recogida y traslado de su hotel en Aswan,Vista con aire acondicionado privado a/desde Abu Simbel,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Ingresos a los templos de Abu Simbel, Agua embotellada a bordo del vehículo,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Comidas o bebidas a menos que se especifique,Tipos &amp;amp; gratuidades, Gastos personales, extras opcionales no mencionados</p></body></html>'),
(341, 89, 'fr', 'Visite d\'une journée à Abu Simbel', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"154\">T&eacute;moin de l\'une des r&eacute;alisations les plus &eacute;tonnantes de l\'&Eacute;gypte antique lors d\'un voyage d\'une journ&eacute;e enti&egrave;re d\'Assouan &agrave; la monumentale<strong data-end=\"295\" data-start=\"270\">Temples of Abu Simbel</strong>. Cut into the cliffs by Ramses II more than 3,000 years ago and relocated by UNESCO in the 1960s to save them from the rising waters of Lake Nasser, these temples stand as a testament to Egyptian power and artistry. Travel in comfort by air-conditioned vehicle with an expert Egyptologist guide and discover the stories, symbolism, and history behind these breathtaking monuments.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"846\">\r\n<p data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"848\"><strong data-end=\"877\" data-start=\"848\">Grand Temple de Rams&egrave;s II</strong>: Admire the colossal 20-metre-high statues guarding the entrance and the richly decorated interior reliefs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"988\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"990\"><strong data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"990\">Temple of Hathor &amp; Nefertari</strong>: Explore the smaller yet equally stunning temple built in honor of Ramses&rsquo; beloved queen.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1115\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1117\"><strong data-end=\"1141\" data-start=\"1117\">UNESCO Heritage Site</strong>: Learn how the temples were cut into blocks and moved to higher ground to save them from the Aswan High Dam&rsquo;s reservoir.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose de votre hôtel à Assouan,Véhicule climatisé privé pour/à partir d\'Abu Simbel,Guide égyptologue agréé,Frais d\'entrée à Abu Simbel temples,Eau bouillante à bord du véhicule,Toutes taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Repas ou boissons sauf indication contraire,Conseils et gratifications,Dépenses personnelles,Extras optionnels non mentionnés</p></body></html>'),
(342, 90, 'en', 'Aswan Tour Philae temple High Dam unfinished obelisk', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d14578.00389591282!2d32.866286688628094!3d24.013392855865767!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x143662bfbe299cbf%3A0xd571ef8bf3780147!2sPhilae!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776690287041!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"677\">Discover the highlights of Aswan on this guided day tour, exploring the city&rsquo;s most iconic landmarks and learning about its unique role in Egypt&rsquo;s ancient and modern history. Visit the <strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"320\">Unfinished Obelisk</strong>, the largest known ancient obelisk left in its quarry; marvel at the graceful <strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"419\">Temple of Philae</strong> on Agilkia Island, dedicated to the goddess Isis; and stand on the <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"499\">High Dam</strong>, one of Egypt&rsquo;s most ambitious modern engineering projects. Travel in comfort with a professional Egyptologist guide and enjoy a fascinating blend of ancient and modern wonders.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"869\"><strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"732\">Unfinished Obelisk</strong>: See a giant obelisk partially carved from the rock bed, revealing ancient stone-working techniques and a flaw that left it abandoned.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1065\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"902\">Philae Temple by Motorboat</strong>: Cruise to Agilkia Island to explore the relocated Temple of Isis, the Kiosk of Trajan, and the Temple of Hathor&mdash;one of Egypt&rsquo;s most beautiful temple complexes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1086\">Aswan High Dam</strong>: Visit the massive dam built in the 1960s to control the Nile&rsquo;s floods and create Lake Nasser.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick-up and drop-off from your hotel in Aswan,Private air-conditioned vehicle,Licensed Egyptologist guide,Entrance fees to all listed sites,Motorboat ride to Philae Temple,Bottled water during the tour,All taxes & service charges', 'Meals or drinks unless specified,Tips & gratuities,Optional extras not mentioned,Personal expenses'),
(343, 90, 'es', 'Aswan Tour Philae templo alta presa sin terminar obelisco', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<p data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"113\">Descubre los puntos m&aacute;s destacados de Aswan en esta visita guiada, explorando los lugares m&aacute;s emblem&aacute;ticos de la ciudad y aprendiendo sobre su papel &uacute;nico en la historia antigua y moderna de Egipto. Visitar<strong data-end=\"320\" data-start=\"298\">Unfinished Obelisk</strong>, the largest known ancient obelisk left in its quarry; marvel at the graceful <strong data-end=\"419\" data-start=\"399\">Temple of Philae</strong> on Agilkia Island, dedicated to the goddess Isis; and stand on the <strong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"487\">High Dam</strong>, one of Egypt&rsquo;s most ambitious modern engineering projects. Travel in comfort with a professional Egyptologist guide and enjoy a fascinating blend of ancient and modern wonders.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"708\">\r\n<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"710\"><strong data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"710\">Obelisco sin terminar</strong>: See a giant obelisk partially carved from the rock bed, revealing ancient stone-working techniques and a flaw that left it abandoned.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"870\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"872\"><strong data-end=\"902\" data-start=\"872\">Philae Temple by Motorboat</strong>: Cruise to Agilkia Island to explore the relocated Temple of Isis, the Kiosk of Trajan, and the Temple of Hathor&mdash;one of Egypt&rsquo;s most beautiful temple complexes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1066\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1068\"><strong data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"1068\">Aswan High Dam</strong>: Visit the massive dam built in the 1960s to control the Nile&rsquo;s floods and create Lake Nasser.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Recogida y traslado de su hotel en Aswan,Vehículo privado con aire acondicionado,Guía egipcia centrada,Precios de entrada a todos los sitios incluidos,Montaje en barco a Philae Temple, Agua embotellada durante el tour,Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Comidas o bebidas a menos que se especifique,Títulos &amp;amp; gratuidades,Opcionales extras no mencionados, Gastos personales</p></body></html>');
INSERT INTO `tour_translations` (`id`, `tour_id`, `locale`, `title`, `duration`, `type`, `run`, `pickup_time`, `overview`, `highlights`, `included`, `excluded`) VALUES
(344, 90, 'fr', 'Aswan Tour Philae temple Haut Dam obélisque inachevé', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<p data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"113\">D&eacute;couvrez les faits saillants d\'Assouan lors de cette visite guid&eacute;e de jour, explorant les monuments les plus embl&eacute;matiques de la ville et apprenant son r&ocirc;le unique dans l\'histoire ancienne et moderne de l\'Egypte. Visitez le<strong data-end=\"320\" data-start=\"298\">Unfinished Obelisk</strong>, the largest known ancient obelisk left in its quarry; marvel at the graceful <strong data-end=\"419\" data-start=\"399\">Temple of Philae</strong> on Agilkia Island, dedicated to the goddess Isis; and stand on the <strong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"487\">High Dam</strong>, one of Egypt&rsquo;s most ambitious modern engineering projects. Travel in comfort with a professional Egyptologist guide and enjoy a fascinating blend of ancient and modern wonders.</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"708\">\r\n<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"710\"><strong data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"710\">Ob&eacute;lisque non fini</strong>: See a giant obelisk partially carved from the rock bed, revealing ancient stone-working techniques and a flaw that left it abandoned.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"870\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"872\"><strong data-end=\"902\" data-start=\"872\">Philae Temple by Motorboat</strong>: Cruise to Agilkia Island to explore the relocated Temple of Isis, the Kiosk of Trajan, and the Temple of Hathor&mdash;one of Egypt&rsquo;s most beautiful temple complexes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1066\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1068\"><strong data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"1068\">Aswan High Dam</strong>: Visit the massive dam built in the 1960s to control the Nile&rsquo;s floods and create Lake Nasser.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Ramassage et dépose de votre hôtel à Assouan,Véhicule climatisé privé,Guide égyptologue agréé,Frais d\'entrée à tous les sites énumérés,Voyage en bateau à Philae Temple,Eau bouillante pendant la visite,Toutes taxes et frais de service</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Repas ou boissons sauf indication contraire,Conseils et gratifications,Extras facultatifs non mentionnés,Dépenses personnelles</p></body></html>'),
(345, 91, 'en', 'Tour To Alexandria From Cairo By Car', '8 Hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d218360.43103488232!2d29.79007206235263!3d31.224005767766844!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14f5c49126710fd3%3A0xb4e0cda629ee6bb9!2sAlexandria%2C%20Alexandria%20Governorate!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689519226!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Pay a visit to Egypt\'s beautiful second city. See rock-cut Roman catacombs, the ruins of a Roman temple complex, and Qaitbey Citadel. Visit the Bibleotheca Alexandrina and enjoy fresh seafood by the Mediterranean.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Pompey&rsquo;s Pillar</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Citadel of Qaitbay</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Bibliotheca Alexandrina</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Bottled water during your trip.,Lunch meal will be served in a local restaurant.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Private Tour Guide,All Taxes & Service Charge.', 'Tipping.,Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.'),
(346, 91, 'es', 'Tour a Alejandría desde El Cairo By Car', '8 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Visita la hermosa segunda ciudad de Egipto. Ver catacumbas romanas cortadas en roca, las ruinas de un complejo del templo romano, y Qaitbey Citadel. Visita la Bibliaotheca Alexandrina y disfruta de mariscos frescos junto al Mediterr&aacute;neo.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Pilar de Pompeya</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Citadel of Qaitbay</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Bibliotheca Alexandrina</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Agua embotellada durante su viaje., La comida se sirve en un restaurante local., Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Guía de Visita Privada,Todos los Impuestos &amp;amp; Servicio Carga.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tipping, Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.</p></body></html>'),
(347, 91, 'fr', 'Visite à Alexandrie du Caire Voiture', '8 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '8 heures', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Visitez la belle deuxi&egrave;me ville d\'&Eacute;gypte. Voir catacombes romaines taill&eacute;es en pierre, les ruines d\'un temple romain complexe, et Qaitbey Citadel. Visitez la Bibleotheca Alexandrina et profitez de fruits de mer frais par la M&eacute;diterran&eacute;e.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Pomp&eacute;e Pilier</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Citadel of Qaitbay</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Bibliotheca Alexandrina</li>\r\n</ul>', '<html><body><p>Eau embouteillée pendant votre voyage., Le déjeuner sera servi dans un restaurant local. Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Guide d\'excursions privés, toutes taxes et frais de service.</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Un coup. Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire.</p></body></html>'),
(348, 92, 'en', 'Cairo Nile Dinner Cruise and Show', '4 Hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3456.2237317974077!2d31.23279447467924!3d29.972999574959584!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x145847bedad2429d%3A0x38fa98ce955cd856!2sCorniche%20El%20Maadi%2C%20Dar%20El%20Salam%2C%20Cairo%20Governorate!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689460033!5m2!1sen!2seg', '6:pm', '<p>Smooth yourself with an evening on the Nile with dinner and a show aboard the diamond boat Nile dinner cruise. Admire the lights of downtown Cairo while enjoying a delicious dinner with a belly dancing and Egyptian folklore show on a two-hour cruise.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Dinner Cruise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', 'All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,Pick up services from your hotel & return.,Entrance fees to all the mentioned sites.,Choice of open buffet,Belly Dancer & Oriental Show,Western Show,All taxes & service charge.,Private Tour Leader', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.,Tipping.,Drinks on cruise'),
(349, 92, 'es', 'El Cairo Nile Cena crucero y espectáculo', '4 horas', 'Tour privado', 'Todos los días', '6:pm', '<p>Divi&eacute;rtete con una noche en el Nilo con la cena y un espect&aacute;culo a bordo del barco de diamante Nilo cena crucero. Admire las luces del centro de El Cairo mientras disfruta de una deliciosa cena con un baile de vientre y espect&aacute;culo de folclore egipcio en un crucero de dos horas.</p>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Cena crucero</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<html><body><p>Todas las transferencias por un vehículo privado con aire acondicionado., Recoger los servicios de su hotel &amp;quot; , Entradas a todos los sitios mencionados., Elección de buffet abierto,Belly Dancer &amp;amp; Oriental Show,Western Show, Todos los impuestos y cargos de servicio., Private Tour Leader</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Cualquier extra no mencionado en el itinerario.,Tipping.,Bebidas en crucero</p></body></html>'),
(350, 92, 'fr', 'Croisière et spectacle pour le dîner au Caire', '4 heures', 'Visite privée', 'Tous les jours', '18 heures', '<p>D&eacute;tendez-vous avec une soir&eacute;e sur le Nil avec d&icirc;ner et un spectacle &agrave; bord du bateau en diamant Nil d&icirc;ner croisi&egrave;re. Admirez les lumi&egrave;res du centre-ville du Caire tout en d&eacute;gustant un d&eacute;licieux d&icirc;ner avec une danse du ventre et un spectacle folklorique &eacute;gyptien sur une croisi&egrave;re de deux heures.</p>', '<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"border border-[#eeeeee] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"pt-4 ps-10 pb-6 text-[#666666]\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">D&icirc;ner Croisi&egrave;re</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<html><body><p>Tous les transferts par un véhicule privé climatisé., Ramassez les services de votre hôtel &amp; retour., Frais d\'entrée sur tous les sites mentionnés., Choix du buffet ouvert,Belly Dancer &amp; Oriental Spectacle, Western Show, Toutes taxes et frais de service, Chef de voyage privé</p></body></html>', '<html><body><p>Tous les extras non mentionnés dans l\'itinéraire.,Tipping.,Boissons en croisière</p></body></html>'),
(351, 93, 'en', 'Day Tour To El Fayoum From Cairo', '8 hours', 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d222919.58875960516!2d30.271147097193133!3d29.19063576983267!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x145bef777593e399%3A0x42b67909acc99ad8!2sWadi%20El%20Rayan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689395344!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p><strong>El Fayoum</strong>&nbsp;Day Trips and sightseeing from&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong> with Private Guided tours to enjoy a unique visit to El Fayoum major sights with Pharaoh Vibes Tours Egypt, Your gate to the country of mysterious, Egypt</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Wadi Elrayan</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Wadi Al-Hitan (Valley of the Whales)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick up service from your hotel in Cairo and back.,Entrance fees to the mentioned historical place.,Bottled water on board the vehicle during the tour.,Private tour guide,All Taxes & Service Charge.,Safari by 4X4 car, Late lunch meal at Lotus village restaurant in EL Fayoum.', 'Any extras not mentioned in the itinerary.,Tipping.'),
