(355, 94, 'en', '5 Days Trip to Siwa and Bahariya Oasis', '5 days', 'Private Tour or Shared Tour', 'Everyday', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Enjoy Tours to Siwa, Bahariya &amp; White Desert to give yourself an incredible holiday enjoying the desert safari life with its marvelous beauty. Wake up every day and have your eyes filled with the magic of the wildlife at the most protected areas in Egypt such as Siwa oases, the amazing White desert and many more.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"150\">Siwa Oasis</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"344\">\r\n<li data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"171\">\r\n<p data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"171\">Shali Old Town</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"189\">\r\n<p data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"189\">Siwa Museum</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"219\">Amun Temple (Om Obayda)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"262\">\r\n<p data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"262\">Oracle Temple of Alexander the Great</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"285\">\r\n<p data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"285\">Cleopatra Spring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"344\">Bir Wahed (hot &amp; cold springs at the Great Sand Sea)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"363\">Bahariya Oasis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"583\">\r\n<p data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"394\">White Desert National Park</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"583\">\r\n<li data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"413\">\r\n<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"413\">Black Desert</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"448\">\r\n<p data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"448\">El Hez Village &amp; Cold Spring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"471\">Crystal Mountain</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"489\">\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"489\">Agabat Area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"537\">\r\n<p data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"537\">Old White Desert (mushrooms &amp; tents area)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"583\">\r\n<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"583\">New White Desert (limestone formations)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick up services from hotel in Cairo & return,The tickets of the national park.,Transfer by a private air-conditioned vehicle,Transfer by a private 4 X 4 vehicle to the white and Black Deserts,Accommodation for 3 nights at Hotel,Accommodation 1 night in desert camping,Meals as mentioned in the Itinerary,Bottled Water & Soft drinks during camping in the desert,All taxes & service charge', 'Tipping,Personal spendings'),
(356, 94, 'es', 'Viaje de 5 días a Siwa y Bahariya Oasis', '5 días', 'Tour privado o Tour compartido', 'Todos los días', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p>Disfrute de Tours a Siwa, Bahariya &amp;amp; White Desert para darte unas incre&iacute;bles vacaciones disfrutando de la vida safari del desierto con su maravillosa belleza. Despierta todos los d&iacute;as y ten tus ojos llenos de la magia de la vida silvestre en las zonas m&aacute;s protegidas de Egipto, como los oasis de Siwa, el incre&iacute;ble desierto blanco y muchos m&aacute;s.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"136\">\r\n<p data-end=\"150\" data-start=\"138\">Siwa Oasis</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"153\">\r\n<li data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"153\">\r\n<p data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"155\">Shali Old Town</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"174\">\r\n<p data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"176\">Siwa Museum</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"219\" data-start=\"192\">\r\n<p data-end=\"219\" data-start=\"194\">Amun Temple (Om Obayda)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"222\">\r\n<p data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"224\">Oracle Temple of Alexander the Great</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"265\">\r\n<p data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"267\">Cleopatra Spring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"288\">\r\n<p data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"290\">Bir Wahed (hot &amp; cold springs at the Great Sand Sea)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"345\">\r\n<p data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"347\">Bahariya Oasis</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"583\" data-start=\"364\">\r\n<p data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"366\">White Desert National Park</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"583\" data-start=\"397\">\r\n<li data-end=\