(528, 97, 'en', '2 Days White Desert and Bahariya Oasis', NULL, 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3629539.8319569435!2d23.5780687875!3d27.32969310000001!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x146a2b8ef7569799%3A0x9b67495392e9a6b2!2zV2hpdGUgRGVzZXJ0IEVneXB0INin2YTYtdit2LHYp9ihINin2YTYqNmK2LbYp9ih!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776694883029!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><strong>2 Days White Desert and Bahariya Oasis Camping Adventure Tour - from Cairo</strong>. Sun Pyramids Tours ensures a smooth and unforgettable experience with a private A/C vehicle, expert desert guides, and all the essentials for a perfect getaway. Begin your journey in&nbsp;<strong>Bahariya Oasis</strong>, where you&rsquo;ll explore natural hot springs, palm groves, and ancient ruins. Then, venture into the surreal landscapes of the White Desert, famous for its unique white rock formations and otherworldly beauty. you&rsquo;ll also visit the striking Black Mountains, and race across the towering sand dunes in 4x4 vehicles, followed by the thrilling sport of&nbsp;<strong>sandboarding</strong>. Glide down the soft desert dunes on a board, marvel at the salt lake, and explore the shimmering Crystal Mountain, Spend a magical night&nbsp;<strong>camping</strong>&nbsp;under the stars, enjoying a traditional Bedouin dinner by the fire. This tour is a perfect escape into&nbsp;<strong>Egypt</strong>&rsquo;s wild, natural beauty. Book your&nbsp;<strong>2 Day White Desert and Bahariya Oasis tour</strong>&nbsp;for an unforgettable desert experience!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">White Desert National Park</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">El Hez Village</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Crystal Mountain &ndash; Western Desert</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Black Desert &ndash; Egypt&rsquo;s Volcanic Landscape</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Transfer by a private air-conditioned vehicle,1 Breakfast meal,1 Lunch meal and 1 Dinner meal,Desert Guide,Round trip transfer cairo / white desert / cairo,desert safari by 4x4 jeep,Accommodation For 1 Night Camping At desert,Private Tour Guide,All Taxes & Service Charge.', 'Tipping'),
