(535, 98, 'en', 'Bird Watching Tour in Aswan', NULL, 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3742981.699374963!2d29.683296030032295!3d23.631016922352813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x14366523ce47a969%3A0x84c03495a39d2d50!2sAswan%20Birdwatching!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776690146709!5m2!1sen!2seg', '8 am', '<p>A wonderful exclusive tour for \'Bird Watchers\' on this 3 hour Bird Watching Tour in Aswan. Take a scenic ride in a felucca around the Cataract Islands to see up to many species of local birds and pretty flora and fauna in a most delightful environment.</p>', NULL, 'Pick up and return service from your Hotel or Cruise in Aswan .,All transfers by a private air-conditioned vehicle.,English-speaking local Guide.,Bottled water during your trip.,All taxes & service charge.', 'Personal expenses,Optional activities,Tipping'),
