(542, 99, 'en', 'Cairo Food Tour', NULL, 'Private Tour', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13814.440945838347!2d31.21792067281376!3d30.048037911898856!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x145840c7487e04cd%3A0x3377b407fe2c3754!2sDowntown%20Cairo%2C%20Bab%20Al%20Louq%2C%20Abdeen%2C%20Cairo%20Governorate!5e0!3m2!1sen!2seg!4v1776689609178!5m2!1sen!2seg', '4:pm', '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"540\">The Cairo Food Tour is a guided culinary experience designed to immerse travelers in Egypt&rsquo;s rich food culture through authentic, local eateries and street food spots. Led by knowledgeable guides, the tour combines history, culture, and gastronomy, taking you through bustling neighborhoods while sampling traditional dishes such as koshary, falafel, shawarma, and Egyptian desserts. It&rsquo;s ideal for food lovers who want to explore Cairo beyond typical tourist attractions and gain insight into daily life through its flavors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"1044\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k0x75j\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1438\">Taste a wide variety of authentic Egyptian dishes in one tour</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qsa1l\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1492\">Explore local neighborhoods and hidden food spots</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ir4sow\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1565\">Learn about Cairo&rsquo;s food culture and traditions from an expert guide</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92x2f0\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1628\">Enjoy a mix of street food and sit-down dining experiences</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9km3kg\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1682\">Small group setting for a personalized experience</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Cultural and historical insights,Bottled water or local beverages,All food tastings (multiple stops),Professional local guide', 'Hotel pickup and drop-off (unless specified),Gratuities (optional),Personal expenses,Additional food or drinks not included in the tasting menu'),
