(556, 100, 'en', 'Private Tour To Mount Sinai & St.catherine Monastery', NULL, 'Private Tour', 'Everyday', '20:00 PM', '<section>\r\n<div class=\"my-12\">\r\n<section class=\"p-4 pb-6 flex flex-col gap-4 border-b-2 border-b-[#EEEEEE]\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-7 text-[#666666] leading-6\">\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Join Sun Pyramids Tours for a thrilling adventure! Climb Moses Mountain under starlit skies, witness a breathtaking sunrise, and explore St. Catherine Monastery. An unforgettable journey awaits!&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:9153,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Join Vive Egiptos for a thrilling adventure! Climb Moses Mountain under starlit skies, witness a breathtaking sunrise, and explore St. Catherine Monastery. An unforgettable journey awaits!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Mount Moses &ndash; Sinai</li>\r\n<li class=\"list-disc mb-1\">Saint Catherine Monastery &ndash; Sinai</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Pick up services from/to your hotel in Sharm ,All transfers by an air-conditioned vehicle,Entrance fees to St. Catherine National Park,Bedouin guide during climbing up the mountain,All services charges and taxes', 'Any extras not mentioned in the program,Tipping Kitty,Personal expenses,beverages and water during lunch.breakfast and dinner'),
